<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id">- Ekajuk Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Abalamalam</para>
  <para style="toc3">Alam</para>
  <para style="toc2">Abalamalam</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nwer nyi Abalamalam</para>
  <para style="mt1">Abalamalam</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JDG 1" />
  <para style="s">Ana anebe Isreel gohro nok a anebe Kenan ba sa no</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 1:1" />Ngare nyio nyi Josua ma kpo, abone Isreel kehm bahbe Jehova re, "Anv, nne awoo bahk-r gboko mbang song nok a anebe Kenan?" <verse eid="JDG 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 1:2" />Owo Jehova kehm faange re, "Nong etˈtohngo ji Juda gboon mbang, m m-e kak edi ndi jia go ebo abo." <verse eid="JDG 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 1:3" />Etˈtohngo ji Juda kehm tongo abonanyehn ba lohng go etˈtohngo ji Simion re, "Ba tob-r nok a anebe Kenan ba wob go ejang ndi ji bo ka-r no, e bahke tob ba tob-n nok a anebe Kenan ba tob li go egahna ndi." Etˈtohngo ji Simion kehm song tob bo. <verse eid="JDG 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 1:4" />Ana anebe Juda tahme ebta, Jehova kehm faake anebe Kenan, a anebe Peres kak bo go abo. Efung bio bo wulu ane atahltahl go eltahl a nkpel elon ejahbe jio ji Besek. <verse eid="JDG 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 1:5" />O wo bo nyehne nne no bo kpo lung-e re Adoni-Besek, kehm kehme elnoko a ne. Bo kame anebe Kenan, a anebe Peres yehke ajahbe nyao. <verse eid="JDG 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 1:6" />Adoni-Besek bˈbe. Bo kam-e song bob, fere kiimi anyohkobo nlumlum, a anyohkgung nlumlum. <verse eid="JDG 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 1:7" />Á kehm soro bung re, "Ana n kiimi atul atahl ara a atul awubu bao anyohkobo nlumlum, a anyohkgung nlumlum bo fere jo kpiimi nsol alehke go egame nla ekpukuru, ano wo Esowo ma-m tob bongo." Bo ko-e ba go Jeusalem, owo á ba kpo. <verse eid="JDG 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 1:8" />Anebe Juda kpe sehng o song nok a Jeusalem, wul ane o kpee, fere jahm ejahbe jio fi. <verse eid="JDG 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 1:9" />Bo kpe sehng ona, song kehme elnoko a anebe Kenan ba lene go ero ewong, a adi nya li go elka emahng go ejang eboblum ejahbe jio, a akpe kpe awong nya li feere erede nfam. <verse eid="JDG 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 1:10" />Bo soro asi ona, song nok a anebe Kenan ba lene go ejahbe ji bo kpo lung re Hebron (bo tohko jo lung ejahbe jio re, Kiriat Aba) bo tob , ga Sesayi, a Ahiman, ngo Talmayi <verse eid="JDG 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 1:11" />Bo kpe sehng o nok anebe Diber (bo tohko jo lung ejahbe jia re, Kiriat Sefer). <verse eid="JDG 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 1:12" />Eji bo ba ebyele ejahbe jio, Keleb tongo abone Isreel re, "Nne awohng awohng no bahke noko a Kiriat Sefer fere sehnge bo, m bahk-e kake Akisa mmon ewame no nkal á ko-e go elbal." <verse eid="JDG 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 1:13" />Otinel, mmon no Kenas, ji jolo mmonannyehna Keleb no nse, song noko a bo, sehng ejahbe jio. Keleb kehm faake mmon ewe Akisa ka-e go elbal. <verse eid="JDG 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 1:14" />Efung abehng Akisa kehm bungu tong Otinel nlum we re, song bahb nsoo, á ka-a edi egbe. Eji bo song rehng eji nde, Akisa badde kan a me go njahm enyˈnya, nde kehm-e bahbe re, "Anv, me n lim jen ka-a?" <verse eid="JDG 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 1:15" />Á kehm faange nde re, "Eji a ma-m ka ndi go ejang eboblum bi alahb ki li, tob ka-m edi go ejang bio bi alahb li gbalee." Nde kehm-e kake mbingilahb nyi li go ero egbe, a nnahb gbe. <verse eid="JDG 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 1:16" />Etˈtohngo jio ji nde nkala Mosis, nne a Ken mehle go ejahbe ji bo jo lung re, ejahbe nsakoro ji bo kpo lung re Jeriko. Bo tahme toono anebe Juda re bo song lene a bo kohlo Arad ji jolo go elka emahng Juda ji li go elka emahng ejang eboblum, . <verse eid="JDG 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 1:17" />Anebe Juda kehm tob tahm song tob abonanyehn, anebe Simion, bo song nok a anebe Kenan ba jolo go Sefat bo rannge ejahbe jio kpee a ane ba lene o kpee. Bo lungu ejahbe jio re Homa (ji lohngo re elrannge). <verse eid="JDG 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 1:18" />Anebe Juda kehm noko ebta fere sehnge Gasa, Askelon, Ekron, fere taare ndi bo kpee. <verse eid="JDG 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 1:19" />Jehova jolo a anebe Juda. Bo taare ajahbe kpee nya kuumu go ero awong. Wo ajahbe nya jolo go ebal, bo maam kam bo, tib bo bele amvtv ebta nya jolo akuungu akuungu nya anyˈnya jo tohng. <verse eid="JDG 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 1:20" />Tib go enyam bi Mosis, bo faake Hebron ka Keleb, ye wo kame abon ba Anak na ara yehke go ejahbe jia.<verse eid="JDG 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 1:21" />Anebe Benjamin ana jolo o, bo maam kam anebe Jebus, ba jolo go Jeusalem, tete rehng efung bia. Bo baa kpe lene go ellong ni anebe Benjamin. <verse eid="JDG 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 1:22" />Etˈtohngo ji Josef ba noko ebta a ejahbe ji bo kpo lung re Betel, Jehova jolo a bo. <verse eid="JDG 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 1:23" />Bo tumu anebe mbehrbehr re bo song weele feede Betel (Betel bo jo lungu re Lus wuku wuku). <verse eid="JDG 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 1:24" />Anebe mbehr mbehr bao kehm wane nne no kpˈlohngo abake go ejahbe jio, bo kehm-e tongo re, "Tib-r mbang nyi e bahke yele go ejahbe jia, a lˈtib-r e wa nehm lim ebi ajehng ajehng." <verse eid="JDG 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 1:25" />Owo á kehm tibi bo mbang bo kehm wulu ane kpee ba li go ejahbe jio, sehngem nne no tibi bo mbang, a ebangenahb eje kpee. <verse eid="JDG 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 1:26" />Nne noa no tibi bo mbang mehle tahm go ndi nyi anebe Hit. Á si ejahbe o, ji á gungu mbing re Lus, mbing nyio nyi bo kpo lung ejahbe jio tete rehng lela. <verse eid="JDG 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 1:27" />Etˈtohngo Manase tobem kam ane ba jolo go Bet San, Taanak, Dor, Iblem, Megido, a ane ba lene sennge ajahbe nyao, tibre anebe Kenan yehke ntir ebo re bo bahke tiki jol o. <verse eid="JDG 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 1:28" />Ngare nyia Isreel bele atahne, bo kamem anebe Kenan yehke kpe kpe, Isreel limi bo bo jol aju jo lim ntum ka bo. <verse eid="JDG 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 1:29" />Jol Efrem tobem kam anebe Kenan ba jolo go Gesar, bo soro asi jo lene a bo. <verse eid="JDG 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 1:30" />Etˈtohngo Sebulon fvfo tobem kam anebe Kenan ba jolo go Kitron, afi Nahalol, bo yake bo re bo lene a bo,wo, go ebo eko, bo rod bo bum aju, jo lim ntum ka bo. <verse eid="JDG 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 1:31" />Jol etˈtohngo Aser kamem anebe Kenan ba jolo go Ako, Sidon, Ahlab, Aksib, Helbbah, Afek, a Rehob. <verse eid="JDG 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 1:32" />Tib esi jio wo etˈtohngo Aser lene edi ajehng a anebe Kenan ba jolo o. <verse eid="JDG 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 1:33" />Etˈtohngo Naftali fvfo kamem anebe Kenan ba lene go Bet Semesh, afi Bet Anat, anebe Naftali tob lene tob anebe Kenan ba jolo afono ejahbe. Anebe Naftali go ebo eko rodo anebe Kenan ba lene go Bet-Semesh, a Bet Anat, bum aju, jo lim ntum . <verse eid="JDG 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 1:34" />Anebe Amor sahde etˈtohngo ji Dan tv go ero ewong, bo kpeem jo taame re bo badde ba ga ebal. <verse eid="JDG 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 1:35" />Anebe Amor tob jabbe tˈtahne ewong ji Heres, a ejahbe ji bo kpo lung re Aijalon, a Saalbim, eji etˈtohngo ji Josef ba bel atahne sehnge bo, bo fere jabbe bo jol aju, jo lim ntum ka bo. <verse eid="JDG 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 1:36" />Nseenge nyi anebe Amor bomo go mmon ntoora mbang no bo kpo lung re Akrebim, no li go eyake awong. Soro asi ano tete rehng go Sela asongo.<verse eid="JDG 1:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JDG 2" />
  <para style="s">Enjel nyi Esowo ba go Bokim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 2:1" />Enjel nyi Jehova mehle go Gilgal tahm go Bokim, kehm bungu tong anebe Isreel re, "N yehk-n go Ijib, fere tv-n ba rehng edi ndi ji n nyame tong bahbnso ejahne re m bahke bo ka. M bung tong bo re, ˈN nehm tiki rannge egbanngalung a nahne, <verse eid="JDG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 2:2" />wahn fvfo kana tiki lim egbanngalung ajehng ajehng a ane ba lene go edi jia, waan agudu njom ebo.ˈ Ḿ m-e wukem. Jenji wahnge ń limi ano? <verse eid="JDG 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 2:3" />Anv, n kp-n tongo re, n nehm tiki kam bo yehke go egahne ellong, bo bahke jolo ana ajoongo ka-n, asowo ebo bahke jolo akpoko fvfo." <verse eid="JDG 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 2:4" />Eji Enjel ma bung nsol nyia kpee tong abone Isreel, bo kehm kehme ellingi wahre wahre. <verse eid="JDG 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 2:5" />Bo kehm soro lung edi jio re Bokim (ji lohngo re abalingaling). Owo bo limi ajom gbalee ka Jehova.<verse eid="JDG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekˈwuk, a elgake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 2:6" />Eji Josua ma yaame anebe Isreel kpee, no nne feere song yel go edi elehkekv eje. <verse eid="JDG 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 2:7" />Nne awohng awohng jo kake Esowo go ngare nyi Josua kpaka li go elkpin, a anebekul ba kpe jol ngare nyi Josua ma kpo, bo ji nyehne akpokosi nya Esowo ma lim ka anebe Isreel.<verse eid="JDG 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 2:8" />Josua mmon no Nun, nlokeltuma Jehova tahme ebim ejok eji á ma kang nnya atahl alon a nnya ewubu. <verse eid="JDG 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 2:9" />Bo kpa-e kak go edi ji á li elkv, ji bo kpo lung re, Timnat Heres, ji jolo go ejahbe awong ji Efrem, ejang ebobkal bi ewong Gaas. <verse eid="JDG 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 2:10" />Eji eying jio ji Josua ma kpo kpee mal, owo eying ji nfenfe kehm kpe ba ji ki kahn Jehova, jol nsol enye nyi á ma lim ka anebe Isreel nnene kahnem. <verse eid="JDG 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 2:11" />Bo limi abiafem gbalee go esamahr Esowo, fere jo loko Baal. <verse eid="JDG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 2:12" />Bo tene Jehova, Esowo bio bi babnde ebo, ye ji yehke bo go ndi nyi Ijib. Bo tahme toono, jo loko asowo nya ane ba lene sennge bo kak. Bo limi Jehova jol erakatahng a bo, <verse eid="JDG 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 2:13" />tib eji bo ten-e no, fere jo loko Baal, a asowo nya Asterot. <verse eid="JDG 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 2:14" />Go erakatahng ji Jehova bele a Isreel, á tumu ane ba kpo da nsol tv bo, bo ba taare nsol ebo kpee. Á tob faake bo kak anebekv kpee ba li sennge bo go abo. Bo maam kpe yiimi bo go abo. <verse eid="JDG 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 2:15" />Ngare anyehng anyehng nyi Isreel lohngo tahm ebta, erakatahng ji Jehova ji jo toono bo, jang jang ana á nyame no. Ejum ajehng ajehng joom kpe nob a bo. <verse eid="JDG 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 2:16" />Owo Jehova kehm yehke abalamalam ba tahre bo yehke go abo ane ba jo da bo nsol. <verse eid="JDG 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 2:17" />Tvtv o, bo joom wuk abalamalam bao, bo kpe jo soro na asi, jo toono asowo nyako fere jo kak bo. Bo ware elyake mbang nyi babnde ebo sehng, bo ji jo kpunu atahm nya Jehova. <verse eid="JDG 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 2:18" />Ngare anyehng anyehng nyi Jehova lˈyehke nlamalam no bahke fili bo, á bahke jolo a ne, fere tahre anebe Isreel yehke go abo anebekv ebo, ngare nyio kpee nyi nlamalam noo kpeka li go elkpin. Tibre jo fili Jehova ndon sehng tib go elnohko, a arem nya abone Isreel jo nyehn fere jo rˈruunu go abo nya anebekv ebo. <verse eid="JDG 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 2:19" />Nlamalam noo lˈkpo, abone Isreel kpe fere jo lim abˈbi nya sehnge nya babnde ebo jo lim, jo toono, jo kak, fere jo loko asowo nyako. Bo tene elyake abi abang ebo. <verse eid="JDG 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 2:20" />Erakatahng ji Jehova kpe gbal na bada Isreel. Owo á kehm bungu re, "Tib eji ejahbe jia ma ten egbanngalung ejame ji n limi a babnde ebo, eji bo kiim wuungu atung, <verse eid="JDG 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 2:21" />n nehm kpe kam ajahbe nyao kpee nya Josua ki kam bo kehm kpoko. <verse eid="JDG 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 2:22" />Bo ba n bahke koko wuungu anebe Isreel, ejoare bo bahk-m toono ana babnde ebo toon-m no." <verse eid="JDG 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 2:23" />Jehova yake ajahbe nyao bum, tib esi jia. Owo wahnge á ki kam bo nkpel nkpel anyehng sehng go abo nya Josua.<verse eid="JDG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JDG 3" />
  <para style="s">Ajahbe nya sa no go ndi nyi Kenan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 3:1" />Ajahbe nya a nya Jehova yake no re bo jol, eji á lˈ ko bo jo wuungu Isreel jio ji ki kahn bade ebta abehng abehng bi jolo Kenan. <verse eid="JDG 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 3:2" />Jehova limi jia, eji abone Isreel ba ki nyi ebta, lˈkpili bade ebta. <verse eid="JDG 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 3:3" />Ajahbe nyao nya a; Atul na alon ba anebe Filistia, anebe Kenan kpee, anebe Sidon, a anebe Hiv, bo ji lene go awong nyao nya Lebanon, bomo go ewong ji Baal Hemon song rehng go nnyo ewong ji Lebo Hamat. <verse eid="JDG 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 3:4" />Bo sa o, eji Jehova lˈko bo jo wuungu Isreel, ejoare Isreel bahke kpunu atahm nya á ka babnde ebo sehng go abo nya Mosis. <verse eid="JDG 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 3:5" />Ane ba a, ba abone Isreel lene a bo, anebe Kenan, anebe Hit, anebe Amor, anebe Peres, anebe Hiv, a anebe Jebus. <verse eid="JDG 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 3:6" />Abone Isreel ko mbal semme na semme a bo, fere jo kak asowo ebo.<verse eid="JDG 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otˈniel, ngbokambang a nne no lame Isreel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 3:7" />Abone ba Isreel limi abiafem go esamahr bi Jehova. Bo yini Jehova Esowo ebo, fere tahm jo loko asowo, Baal abola Asera. <verse eid="JDG 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 3:8" />Jehova kehm bele egburu erakatahng bada anebe Isreel kehm faake bo kak ntul no Aram Naharim go ebo, no bo jo lung-e re Kusan-Risatem, ye wo Isreel jolo aju enye go nnya enehkeni. <verse eid="JDG 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 3:9" />Eji anebe Isreel lingi tong Jehova re á tob bo, owo á kehm yehke nnenlum awohng, re á song tahre bo. Bo jo lung-e re Otˈniel, á jolo mmona mmonannyehn no Keleb no nse, no bo jo lung-e re Kenas. <verse eid="JDG 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 3:10" />Etohko ji Jehova kehm ba jol a ne, á jol nne no bahke lame Isreel. Á kehm ba tahm ebta, song nok a ntula Kusan Risatem, ye ji jolo ntul no Aram. Esowo ka Otˈniel esehngebta go abohng nyao. <verse eid="JDG 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 3:11" />Elkoono jolo ejahbe jio nnya atahl abal, tete Otˈniel ji mmona Kenas kpo.<verse eid="JDG 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ehud, etoono nlamalam no Isreel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 3:12" />Owo abone Isreel kehm kpe lim abiafem go esamahr bi Jehova. Tib go esi abiafem ebo, Jehova ka ntula Moab nsahm, no bo jo lung-e re Eglon á ba nok sehnge Isreel. <verse eid="JDG 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 3:13" />Ntul noa ko anebe Amon, a anebe Amalek budu elne, ba nok a Isreel, taare bo Jeriko ejahbe nsakoro. <verse eid="JDG 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 3:14" />Anebe Isreel jolo aju ka Eglon ntul no Moab go elku a nnya era. <verse eid="JDG 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 3:15" />Eji abone Isreel lingi tong Jehova re á kak bo ebo. Á kehm kake bo nnenlum awohng no jo lim ebobkal, no bo jo lung-e re Ehud mmon no Gera, á lohng go etˈtohngo ji Benjamin. Abone Isreel kehm-e kake akpohko etak re á song ka Eglon ntula Moab. <verse eid="JDG 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 3:16" />Ehud limi ekahngkahng njahmbal, labe ana eyake ebnyohkobo ebbal. Á rodo gba go eyo ji ejang eboblum, kak nsol bulu. <verse eid="JDG 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 3:17" />Á song faake akpohko nyao kpee ka Eglon, Eglon jolo njokojoka nne. <verse eid="JDG 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 3:18" />Eji Ehud m-e ka akpohko nyao, á kehm feere song tv ane ba solo akpohko nyao ba a nya. <verse eid="JDG 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 3:19" />Eji á song rehng edi ji bo jo ko atal ramme asowo, kohlo Gilgal, owo á kehm feere ba kpiri ntula Eglon kehm-e tongo re, "Nsoo ntul, n kpi etib bi m bahk-a tongo mbehrmbehr." Ntul kehm tongo ane ba kpo lok-e re , ˈTohk-m ka wahn eyake.ˈ Bo kehm mehle lohng alatahk. <verse eid="JDG 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 3:20" />Ntul jii antahng go ekpˈkpa ji kpˈnaange go ero nkimi nyi li ege etahk, owo Ehud kehm jeere kohl-e, kehm-e tongo re, "N ko etib bi lohng goji Esowo re me m ba ka-a. Ana ntul mehle go ege eti, <verse eid="JDG 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 3:21" />ano wo Ehud kehm koko ebobkal wob ekahngkahng ebe go eyo eboblum, kehm jahme ntul ekahngkahng bio sa o , <verse eid="JDG 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 3:22" />lahme tete ekpare yel go atahng, afom tahl bulu. Ano wo Ehud yake ekahngkahng bio sa-e go ala, lahme tete bohngo njahm<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Afii "abahng bohngo."</char></note>. <verse eid="JDG 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 3:23" />Ehud kehm bame abu nyao nya eyong, fere ta, fere sehng nkpaame nkpaame badde eje tahm. <verse eid="JDG 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 3:24" />Eji Ehud ma tahm, owo alokeltum ntul feere no ba, kehm ba nyehn abutahk bo ma ta. Ntir atahng nyi bo jolo re, "Yebtahm esuku go nkimi nyi atahng." <verse eid="JDG 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 3:25" />Eji bo ma sik ekidi ma lab, ntul ki lennge mbutahk, limi bo ndon, bo kehm ba rod egbokoro, ba lennge abu, nyehn ntula bo nong go ndi ma kpo. <verse eid="JDG 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 3:26" />Ngare nyio nyi alokeltum ji jo sik nyi nyi Ehud be for. Á song sehnge edi atal ji bo jo ramme elokelom sa, song rehng go Seira. <verse eid="JDG 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 3:27" />Eji á rehnge , á kehm woro ntang, anebe Isreel kehm lohngo gbalee, á kehm gboko bo mbang jo badde asongo. <verse eid="JDG 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 3:28" />Á kehm tongo bo re, "Toon-m wahn, Jehova ebfaake anebe Moab ba li anebekv ebahne kak-r go abo." Bo kehm-e toono song taare elga anehng anehng ni bo kpo siiri aya ma Jodan tahm go Moab, re nne ekv awohng awohng kˈsiiri. <verse eid="JDG 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 3:29" />Ano wo bo noko a anebe Moab, fere wul ane atahltahl go eltahl a nkpel elon. Ane bao ba jolo nsoja ebo nyi jo sahb tˈtahne. Nne awohng awohng go ebo ellong forem. <verse eid="JDG 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 3:30" />Efung bio bi, anebe Isreel ga anebe Moab, anebe Moab fere jol aju ka bo, bomo ngare nyio asongo anebe Isreel jolo go elkoono nnya atahl ani.<verse eid="JDG 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samga wo biingi ane ara ba lame anebe Isreel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 3:31" />Eji Ehud ma kpo, Samga mmon no Anat wo tob ba lam anebe Isreel.Ye fvfo tob tahre anebe Isreel. Á ko ebti bi bo kpo jamme adamagbudu, wul ane atahltahl, atahl awubu ba Filistia.<verse eid="JDG 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JDG 4" />
  <para style="s">Debora wo biingi ane ani ba lame Isreel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 4:1" />Eji Ehud ma kpo, abone Isreel kpe feere song kehme abˈbi lim go esamahr bi Jehova. <verse eid="JDG 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 4:2" />Jehova faake bo ka ntula Kenan, no bo jo lung-e re Jabin ji lohng go Hasor. Ntubesi nnea nsoja ewe, bo jo lung-e re Sisera, á jolo go ejahbe ji bo jo lung re Haroset Hagoyim. <verse eid="JDG 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 4:3" />Sisera bele amvtv ebta nya bo limi akuungu akuungu nya anyˈnya jo tohng, nya jolo amvtv atahltahl nkpel ebal a amvtv atahl alon. Á nohko abone Isreel go nnya eltahl. Abonee Isreel kehm lingi tong Jehova re á kak bo ebo. <verse eid="JDG 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 4:4" />Ngare nyia Debora nnyehnamahr no jolo nkala Lapidot, ye wo jo lam Isreel. <verse eid="JDG 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 4:5" />Á jo lame ane go ala nsakoro nya Debora, edi ji jolo elka elka ni ejahbe ji Rama a Betel, edi ndi ji Efrem ji jolo awong awong, edi jio ji anebe Isreel kpee jo ba kpir-e á jo toobo atong tong ebo. <verse eid="JDG 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 4:6" />Efung abehng á kehm tumu tv Barak mmona Abinoam, ye ji jolo go ejahbe ji Kedesh ji li go edi ndi ji Naftali. Á kehm-e tongo re, "Ejum ji a, ji Jehova, ye ji li Esowo bi Isreel kpa-a tongo re wo tiki lim: ˈSong wo song yehke anebelum atahltahl go eltahl a nkpel elon, bo ji li atakuru, go etˈtohngo ji Naftali, a ji Sebulon, wo tahm abo go ewong ji bo kpo lung re Tabor. <verse eid="JDG 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 4:7" />M bahke melle Sisera ntubesi nne a nsoja no Jabin go eltim re á rod amvtv ebta enye, a abanokebta ebe, ba wan-n go aya ma Kison. O wo m bahk-e faake kak-a go ebo, a sehng-e go ebta.ˈ " <verse eid="JDG 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 4:8" />Barak kehm-e faange re, "A tohk-m toono me n nehm je, a lˈtoon-m, m bahke jeke." <verse eid="JDG 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 4:9" />Debora kehm-e tongo re, "Ebnob sehng, m bahke jeke a na. Eji a ma yiimi re me m ba, ekpunu nehm jol jˈja. Nnenkal wo Jehova bahke faake Sisera kak-e go abo." Debora kehm toono Barak tahm go Kedesh. <verse eid="JDG 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 4:10" />Eji bo rehnge go Kedesh, Barak kehm kuku etˈtohngo ji Sebulon, a ji Naftali, anebelum atahltahl eltahl a nkpel elon, bo lohng toon-e tahm ebta. Debora fvfo tˈtob je a bo. <verse eid="JDG 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 4:11" />Ngare nyia Heber ji lohng go ebangenahb ji Ken, á lohng go etˈtohngo ji Hobab, nnar a Mosis, yeblohng go elwo ni ane ebe song si etahk go egburu nnahb eti nyi li go Saananim ji li kohko Kedesh. <verse eid="JDG 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 4:12" />Eji bo tongo Sisera re Barak mmona Abinoam ebrehng go ewong ji Tabor, <verse eid="JDG 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 4:13" />á kehm rodo abanokebta ebe, a amvtv akuungu akuungu nya á jo ko nok ebta, jolo mmvtv atahltahl nkpel ebal, a mmvtv atahl alon. Bo bomo eljen ebo go ejahbe ji bo kpo lung re Haroset Hagoyim asongo go aya ma Kison. <verse eid="JDG 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 4:14" />Owo Debora kehm tongo Barak re, "Toobo ebjing. Lela Jehova ma-a gbo mbang, yebfaake Sisera kak-a go ebo, ebta bia." Barak kehm soro mehl a nsoja enye, bo jolo asoja atahltahl eltahl, a nkpel elon, fere jo badde ewong Tabor asongo go edi ebta. <verse eid="JDG 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 4:15" />Ana Barak bomo ebta, Jehova kehm kake Sisera elsemme go ellong nsoja enye, a amvtv ebta enye bo be faade.Tete yefono Sisera yehb gbo go ege mmvtv ebta nyi á woomo no, be akpade akpade akpade. <verse eid="JDG 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 4:16" />Owo Barak kehm kehme nsoja enye kam, a amvtv ebta ebo, mbang mbang tete rehng go Haroset-Hagoyim. Bo wulu nsoja Sisera kpee, jol na wohng saam. <verse eid="JDG 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 4:17" />Yefono Sisera be akpade akpade song yel go mobkpatahk no Jayel nkal no Heber ji lohng go etˈtohngo Ken, tibre ntul a Hasor no bo jo lung-e re Jabin jolo etem a ejahbe ji Heber nne a Ken <verse eid="JDG 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 4:18" />Jayel kehm lohngo go ege mmobkpatahk song wane Sisera kehm bungu tong-e re, "Ba nsoo, ba ka fahl. Á kehm song yel go ege ebkpatahk, Jayel kehm-e konngo egbvgbv. <verse eid="JDG 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 4:19" />Sisera kehm-e tongo re, “Alahb ma-m kor, ka-m alahb me n wo." Jayel kehm lennge ekpukpuk ji bo ko ngunyam lim ka-e alahbbel nfong re á wo, fere feere egbvgbv konng-e. <verse eid="JDG 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 4:20" />Sisera kehm tongo Jayel re, “Yiimi mbutahk, nne awohng awohng lˈba bahb-a re, ˈNne noa aa?ˈ Tong-e re nnene limm." <verse eid="JDG 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 4:21" />Eji Sisera ma gbo ellu tib go ellahnge ni á ma lahng, Jayel nkala Heber kehm rodo efamfam, a ngan, kehm nyaabe song kum Sisera go nwonngo etung bade ndi, á kpo. <verse eid="JDG 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 4:22" />Eji Barak ba rehng, kpi Sisera seb, Jayel kehm song wan-e, kehm-e tongo re, "Ba, m bahk-a tibi nne no a kp-e sebe." Á kehm-e toono yel go mmobkpatahk, song nyehn Sisera nong no, bo m-e kum ebfamfam go nwonngo etung, á ma kpo. <verse eid="JDG 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 4:23" />Efung bio Esowo ga Jabin ji ntula Kenan, go esamahr bi anebe Isreel. <verse eid="JDG 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 4:24" />Abone Isreel kpe bel atahne gbalee sehnge Jabin ntula Kenan, tete bo wul-e.<verse eid="JDG 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JDG 5" />
  <para style="s">Ese ji Debora yimi no</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 5:1" />Efung bio Debora, a Barak mmona Abinoam yimi ese jia; <verse eid="JDG 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 5:2" />"Ngare nyi atubesi anebe Isreel lˈgbo mbang, lˈtob kor ane fvfo re bo rod elbo lim eltum, tehken Jehova!. <verse eid="JDG 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 5:3" />"Wuungen atung, wahn atul, wuungu wahn ji kpi ane fili. M bahke yimi tehk Jehova, m bahke yimi, m bahke kubu ase ka Jehova, ye ji li Esowo bi Isreel. <verse eid="JDG 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 5:4" />"O Jehova, ngare nyi á mehle go Seir jo sehng go nla ejahbe nyi Edom, ndi gbˈgbehke, elbung na elahb, akparesemsem tob na alahb. <verse eid="JDG 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 5:5" />Awong gbehke go esamahr Jehova, Esowo bi Sinayi, ano wo jolo go esamahr bi Jehova, Esowo bi anebe Isreel <verse eid="JDG 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 5:6" />"Go afung nyao nya Samga mmona Anat, go afung nya Jayel, ane yaange abang, ane ba yaange abang jo sehng go abang ekulugbe. <verse eid="JDG 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 5:7" />Abonea ane abikabik sa go abon ajahbe ba Isreel, tete Debora kehm bake ana nnyehn nne go Isreel. <verse eid="JDG 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 5:8" />Eji abone Isreel yehke asowo nfenfe, ebta ba rehng go bo ati mbu. Jol go ellong atakuru ane ebo, ba jolo ane atahltahl nkpel atahl alon, ejum ebta ajehng ajehng jolem ana ekum, afi elkong <verse eid="JDG 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 5:9" />Eltim ename li go eji atubesi ba Isreel, a ane ba bele ekor rod elbo ka. Tehken Jehova! <verse eid="JDG 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 5:10" />“Wuungen atung, wahn ji jehk abarebare ebvankang go njahm, nya bo ma kunu agbvgbv nya kpˈkpoodo, a wahn ji kpˈjene go akpade. <verse eid="JDG 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 5:11" />wuungen abayimase atung bo ji jehk go abingilahb , bo kpˈfange anoobo nsol nya Jehova ma lim, a esehnge ebta, ji á ma ka atahntahna anebe Isreel. "Ane ba Jehova jene tete song rehng go ati mbu. <verse eid="JDG 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 5:12" />ˈDebora mehl mehl, mehl wo yim ase. Mehl yiimi Barak! Rod anebekv eba ba a ma bob song, mmona Abinoam.ˈ <verse eid="JDG 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 5:13" />Ane bao ba sa no, feere ba kpiri atubesi ebo. Bo ji jolo ka Jehova ba kpir-m, a etoobo ebjing ji bo bahke noko ebta a atakuru nya njahm nyehko. <verse eid="JDG 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 5:14" />Ane bako lohng go etˈtohngo ji Efrem, edi jio ji tohko jol ka anebe Amalek; etˈtohngo ji Benjamin fvfo tob woomo go ellong ane ba jo toon-n. Bomo go etˈtohngo ji Makir, atakuru bomo eljene abake, bo johko lohng go etˈtohngo ji Sebulon ji jolo atubesi ebta. <verse eid="JDG 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 5:15" />Atubesi ba Aisaka tob jolo a Debora, a Barak, jo toono bo asongo go edamme. Go nfam nyi Ruben nne ne bumem ntir nyi eljeke. <verse eid="JDG 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 5:16" />Jenji wahnge a sa go njahm go etahngga ebul, re wo wuk ana abaabebul kpi afiri wor kon ebul re bo ba kono edi ajehnga? Go ejahbe ji Ruben, a nnene bumem ntir nyi eljeke. <verse eid="JDG 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 5:17" />Anebe Gilied sa go egbuk aya Jodan jehko. Jenji wahnge anebe Dan sa go edi ji bo kpo bum asohkkahng? Anebe Aser sa go edi ebo, ji li go elga, edi ji bo kpo bum agbang ebo. <verse eid="JDG 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 5:18" />Anebe Sebulon yake elkpin ebo ka, ana anebe Naftali ka go emahng ebta. <verse eid="JDG 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 5:19" />"Atul lohngo ba nok. Atul bao ba ajahbe nya Kenan lohngo ba nok ebta go Taanak nkpe aya ma Megido, bo maam da asilva. <verse eid="JDG 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 5:20" />Go elbung alonlo sa nok ebta, bo sa go adi bo nok a Sisera. <verse eid="JDG 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 5:21" />Aya ma Kison ma feenge bo tahm, akˈkulu aya mao. Bel ekakeltim, etohko ejame, wo jen song. <verse eid="JDG 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 5:22" />Akpade nya anyˈnya kehm jo jahre na jahre go ndi jo wahl , bo jo ware abahl, bo jolo atahntahn anyˈnya nya ebta. <verse eid="JDG 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 5:23" />Enjel nyi Jehova kehm bungu re, ˈNkuk nyi nnen jol ka ejahbe ji bo kpo lung re Meros, a ane ebe, tibre bo baam ba kak Jehova ebo, eji atakuru ane baa a jo nok a bo.ˈ <verse eid="JDG 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 5:24" />"Nong elfuulu ga jol ka Jayel go ellong anebkal, ye ji li nkal no Hebar, nne no lohng etˈtohngo ji Ken. Elfuulu ga jol ka-e, go ellong anebkal ba lene go abonkpatahk. <verse eid="JDG 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 5:25" />Eji Sisera bahb-e alahb re á wo, Jayel ka-e alahbbel nfong ma bo ki semme alahb. Á kak-e go mmohk nyi atul kpo wo. <verse eid="JDG 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 5:26" />Jayel rodo efamfam, go eboblum, á rodo ngan. Á kehm kumu kak Sisera go esi, lahm bohngo njahm nyehko. <verse eid="JDG 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 5:27" />Á gbo, sa noongo o ndi, á gbo go ege alata, edi ji á gbo no owo á noongo no kpo. <verse eid="JDG 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 5:28" />“Nnyehn no Sisera jo seenge sehng go ewindu, eji á li go ege atahng ekpˈkpa, á ji re á nyehn re mmon kpˈfeere kehnge, á kehm kehme elbungu re, “Nˈnan mmvtv akuungu akuungu enye ma laange go elkehnge? Nˈnan n kala tiki wuk agare mmvtv akuungu akuungu enye kpˈbake? <verse eid="JDG 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 5:29" />"Nfaange lohngo anyo nya akahnkahn anebkal ba jolo jo limi eltum a ne, á jo bungu ntahngtahng re: <verse eid="JDG 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 5:30" />ˈBahke jolo re, bo kpˈbaange nsol nyi bo ma da . Nnenlum awohng awohng bahke ma bel ngbahme anyehng, afi ebal ebal. Bahke ma jol re bo kpˈbaange abomo nya bo ma tub go nkpiida nkpiidi ka Sisera, nyandiki bo bahke koko ba ka-m.ˈ <verse eid="JDG 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 5:31" />"Jehova, nong anebekv eba kpee kpo ana Sisera. Nong nne awohng awohng no wo kp-e koro jol ana njul nyi ma ta elbange lohng go eko eje."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 5:31">Nnya atahl abal Isreel jolo ebo soom.<verse eid="JDG 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JDG 6" />
  <para style="s">Gideon wo biingi ane alon ba lame Isreel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 6:1" />Abone Isreel kehm kpe lim abiafem go esamahr bi Jehova. Go nnya esehma, Jehova yake bo, bo song jol aju go elwo ni anebe Midia. <verse eid="JDG 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 6:2" />Tib go esi ji anebe Midia jo sab bo go elfili , abone Isreel be rehng go ero awong, song biiri go akpatal, agohng, a eko ebta. <verse eid="JDG 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 6:3" />Ngare anyehng anyehng nyi abone Isreel lˈbahm nsol, anebe Midia, a anebe Amalek, a ane bako ba lohng ero nfam, bahke bake ba kehme elnoko a bo. <verse eid="JDG 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 6:4" />Bo sa o kak elsi, jo rannge nsol alehke ebo tete rehng go Gasa. Jol ejum ajehng ajehng ji ellehke, bo kpeem jo yake ka Isreel, ejoro, adamagbudu, a ebvankang, ebvankang kpee. <verse eid="JDG 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 6:5" />Bo jo ba a atohkondi atohkondi ebo, a nkpatahk, ana elkpa agohrobi. Jol a nehm ma fange bo, a akamel akamel ebo. Tete bo li nsol kpee mal, kehm feere. <verse eid="JDG 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 6:6" />Eji anebe Midia ma li nsol abone Isreel kpee mal, owo abone Isreel kehm lingi tong Jehova re, á kak bo ebo. <verse eid="JDG 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 6:7" />Eji abone Isreel lingi tong Jehova tib go esi ji anebe Midia, <verse eid="JDG 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 6:8" />á tumu bo nnyehnamahr no bungu re, "Ji ji a, ji Jehova, Esowo bi Isreel bungu no: n yehk-n go eju bi ń jolo go Ijib. <verse eid="JDG 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 6:9" />N tahr-n yehke go elnohko ni anebe Ijib, a ane kpee ba jo nohk-n. N kame anebekv ebahne, fere ka-n ndi abo. <verse eid="JDG 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 6:10" />N bungu tong-n re, ˈMe wo li Jehova, bi li Esowo ebahne; kana tiki kak asowo nya anebe Amor, bo ji ń lene eboa ndi.ˈ Jol ḿ m-e wukem." <verse eid="JDG 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 6:11" />Owo enjel nyi Jehova kehm ba ji go nnahb eti nyi bo kpo lung re oak ji li nfam nyi Ofra. Edi jio jolo ka Joas ji lohng ebangenahb ji Abieser. Gidion mmon a Joas jo ruumu nsam o edi ji bo kpo kaame amahm yehke go akab greb, eji anebe Midia lˈkˈnyehn. <verse eid="JDG 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 6:12" />Owo enjel nyi Jehova kehm ba kpir-e kehm-e tongo re, "Jehova li a na, wo egburu ntakuru." <verse eid="JDG 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 6:13" />Gidion kehm faange re, "Nsoo, lˈjol re Jehova li anahre, jenji wahnge nsol nyia kpee kp-r limi? Akpokosi nyanehm nya na, nya babnsoo tong-r bade, eji bo bungu re, anv Jehova sang yehk-r go ndi nyi Ijiba? Á ma feere ba tahng-r tub, faak-r kak anebe Midia go ebo. <verse eid="JDG 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 6:14" />Owo Jehova kehm sennge fere go ege, kehm bungu re, "Song go nsahm nyi a kpi no, song tahre anebe Isreel yehke go ebo bi anebe Midia. Me wo kp-a tumu." <verse eid="JDG 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 6:15" />Gidion kehm faange re, "Anv, Jehova m bahke limi renan, kehm tahre anebe Isreel? Ebangenahb ejame ji li morennge ebangenahb go etˈtohngo ji Manase, ga me n li erennge nne go egame ebangenahb." <verse eid="JDG 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 6:16" />Jehova kehm bungu tong-e re, "M bahke jolo a na. Á bahke noko a anebe Midia rannge bo, are a kpˈnoko a nne awohng." <verse eid="JDG 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 6:17" />Gidion kehm faange re, "Lˈjol go etingitingi re a bahk-m kake ebo, tib-m elliingi re wo wo kpˈbungu aname. <verse eid="JDG 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 6:18" />Ka tahm tete me n song ko ejum elyare ejame ba kaa. Jehova kehm faange re, "M bahke jolo a tete, a je feere." <verse eid="JDG 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 6:19" />Owo Gidion kehm yange go ege etahk, song wul mmombul baange, fere rod abe nya bahke ruru eltahl a ngbugu ebal lim abred nya ayist ki wob go atahng. Á kake nnyam go ejeere, kak abehne go mmotu, kehm koko ba ka enjel nyi ji go nnahb eti nyi bo kpo lung re Oak. <verse eid="JDG 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 6:20" />Enjel nyi Esowo kehm bungu tong-e re, "Rod nnyam nyio, a abred nyao nya ayist ki wob atahng kunu go ekpartal, yaange abehne nyao wohngo." Gidion kehm limi ano. <verse eid="JDG 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 6:21" />Enjel kehm rodo ebti bi á fili go ebo, kooro nnyam, a abred nyao. Agun kehm seke go ekpartal jio fere fi nnyam nyio, a abred. Enjel nyi Jehova soro lamme. <verse eid="JDG 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 6:22" />Eji Gidion sebe kahn re enjel nyi Jehova nyi, á kehm rabe, "Nsoo Jehova! Me n nyehn enjel nyi Jehova gbul gbul gbuul!" <verse eid="JDG 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 6:23" />Jehova kehm bungu re, "Elkoono jol a na, ka fahl, a nehm kpo." <verse eid="JDG 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 6:24" />Gidion kehm limi egudu njom ka Jehova edi jio, fere jo lung re, Jehova wo li Elkoono. Jia yim tete tub lela go ejahbe ji Ofra, go edi ndi ji ebangenahb ji Abieser. <verse eid="JDG 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 6:25" />Atv manehm o, Jehova kehm-e tongo re, "Yehke etoono mmona nfong no nlum no ga gbal, go ellong enyam nso, no ma kang nnya esehma. Far egudu njom Baal ji nso, tob kim ego ji Asera ji li kohlo o tub go ndi. <verse eid="JDG 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 6:26" />Lim egudu njom ji nno a nno ka Jehova edi ewong jia. Ko nfong , wo lim njom nyi bo kpo jahm na fi. Ko ego ji Asera ji a kimi no tub, ana nkun. <verse eid="JDG 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 6:27" />Gidion kehm rodo alokeltum ebe na awubu, bo song lim jang jang ana Jehova tong-e no. Á Limem jia a, njul á limi atv, tibre elfahle jol-e jol bade ebangenahb eje, a ane ba jolo go nfam. <verse eid="JDG 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 6:28" />Efungfu eji ane ma nyahme, bo kehm sebe kahn re, egudu njom ji Baal bobwa, tob kim ego Asera tub go ndi, bo limi egudu njom ji nfenfe, fere ko etoono mmona nfong no nlum no ga gbal lim njom kunu o. <verse eid="JDG 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 6:29" />Ane kehm kehme elbahbe atemtem, "Nne awo limi ejum jia? Eji bo feede nobnob, bo kehm tongo bo re, Gidion mmon a Joas wo limi." <verse eid="JDG 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 6:30" />Anebelum ba ejahbe jio kehm tongo Joas re, yehke mmon ewe ba a ne, á bahke tiki kpo na, tibre yebwa egudu njom ji Baal, fere kim ego ji Asera ji jolo kohlo o tub go." <verse eid="JDG 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 6:31" />Owo Joas kehm faange agbanne bao ba lohngo no ba re, "Wahn ba kpˈgboko siki ka Baala? Wahn ba bahke noko ka-ea? Nne no lˈnok ka-e, bo bahke ye wul behna efungfu! Lˈjol re Baal esowo bi, nong á nok a nne no rannge egudu njom eje antahng." <verse eid="JDG 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 6:32" />Bomo efung bio asongo, bo jo lungu Gidion re, Jerubaal, ji lohngo re, "Nong Baal nok ka elne antahng." Tibre á wa egudu njom ji Baal. <verse eid="JDG 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 6:33" />Gaam kpe kang nsoja nyi Midia, a nyi Amalek, a nyehko nyi lohng go ero nfam kpa njahm mehl ebta a abone Isreel. Bo siiri aya ma Jodan, ba kak elsi ebo, jolo go edamme ji Jesreel. <verse eid="JDG 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 6:34" />Owo Etohko ji Jehova kehm ba yel Gidion. Á kehm ba wor ntang a nnyam, yehke ane re bo tahm ebta, ane ba lohng go nnahb ji Abieser lohng ba go ege <verse eid="JDG 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 6:35" />Á tumu abatiingetib tv etˈtohngo ji Manase, , Aser, Sebulon, a Naftali, re bo rod nsol ebta, bo kpee lohng song kpir-e. <verse eid="JDG 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 6:36" />Gidion kehm bungu tong Esowo re, "Lˈjol re a bahke tahre abone Isreel sehng go egame ebo, ana a nyame no, <verse eid="JDG 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 6:37" />tib-m go mbang nyia, m bahke bumu ngunyam go edi ji bo kpo ruumu nsam, ebohng lˈna suku ngunyam nyi nyi, ndi jol wum wum, m bahke kahne re, a bahke tahre abone Isreel sehng go egame ebo ana a ma bung." <verse eid="JDG 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 6:38" />Ano wo jolo no ful ful fuul. Gidion kehm nyahme etoono efung, song rod ngunyam nyio kaame, rur na go ekpingi erukabo. <verse eid="JDG 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 6:39" />Gidion kehm bungu tong Jehova re, "Titi nong atahng ki-a rak tob-m. Nong me n kpe ko ngunyam nyia bahb-a ejum ajehng. Anv, lim ngunyam nyia jol wumwum, nong ebohng suku go ndi kpee." <verse eid="JDG 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 6:40" />Atv mao Esowo limi ano, efungfu ngunyam jolo wum wum, ndi kpee suku tib ebohng.<verse eid="JDG 6:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JDG 7" />
  <para style="s">Gidion gaa anebe Midia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 7:1" />Gidion (ye ji tob li Jerubaal) a nsoja enye kehm mehle efungfu behre behre jen song rehng go elbing alahb ni bo jo lung re Harod. Nsoja nyi Midia ebbum elsi ebo go ejang ebobkal ebo, feere go edamme ji li kohlo ewong ji More <verse eid="JDG 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 7:2" />Owo Jehova kehm bungu tong Gidion, "Atakuru anebe ebta ba li a na ebrur sehng. N lˈyake bo ane kpee re bo song nok a anebe Midia, anebe Isreel bahke woro nnyo re eko ebo ji ma ka bo esehngebta. <verse eid="JDG 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 7:3" />Tong abone Isreel re, ˈNne awohng awohng no kpˈfahle, nobo re á yake ewong Gilied feere kehnge.ˈ " Nsoja atahltahl nkpel atahl abal a nkpel elku, kim kuuk feere kehnge. Nsoja nyi sa no jolo atahltahl, eltahl a nkpel elon. <verse eid="JDG 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 7:4" />Jehova kehm kpe bung tong Gidion re, "Erik nsoja ebkpe tiki gbal sehng. Rod bo wo song go ebgba, go wo m bahke jeke, nne no n lˈtong re ye wo bahke jeke á je a na, nne no n lˈtong re á kˈje á nehm je." <verse eid="JDG 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 7:5" />Gidion kehm koko ane bao tahm ebgba. Jehova kehm-e tongo re, "Ane ba jamme alahng, kohk nnyo jo wo alahb ana mbv nong bo yiimi ejang abehng." <verse eid="JDG 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 7:6" />Ane atahlku ba jo ko abo jo kpe alahb wo, egom jehko kpee jamme na alahng kohk nnyo jo wo alahb. <verse eid="JDG 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 7:7" />Jehova kehm tongo Gidion re, “Ane atahlku baa ba jo ko abo jo kpe alahb wo, bo ba m bahk koko, nok ga anebe Midia, fere tahr-a. Tum ane bako kpee bo kehnge." <verse eid="JDG 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 7:8" />Ane atahlku ba sa goji Gidion, bako a taare bo nsol ebta, a atang, fere tum bo kehnge. Elsi ni anebe Midia jolo edamme, Gidion a ane ebe bo kuumu ewong <verse eid="JDG 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 7:9" />Atv mao Jehova kehm tongo Gidion re, "Mehl wo song go elsi ni Midia, tibre n kpˈsebe re me n rod bo kak-n go abo. <verse eid="JDG 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 7:10" />Lˈjol re a kpˈfahle eljeke go ebo elsi, song a nlokeltum ewe no bo kpo lung-e re Pura, <verse eid="JDG 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 7:11" />wuungu atung wo wuk ji bo kpˈbungu, eji a lˈbel esahb ji a bahke song nok a bo." Ano wo Gidion abola Pura nlokeltum ewe badde tahm song rehng kohlo go ebo elsi. <verse eid="JDG 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 7:12" />Anebe Midia, a anebe Amalek, a ane bako kpee ba lohng go ero nfam, bo ebba rur go edamme, bo jolo ana ellong agorobi. Akamel ebo ruru ana erikehndi bi li go nkpe aya. <verse eid="JDG 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 7:13" />Eji Gidion rehnge o, á wuku nne no kpi ntem nlem lak re, "N leeme nlem, n nyehne ebred ji jolo bannge bannge, ji bo ko abe nya lohng go bali lim, kpˈbannge abake go elsi ni anebe Midia, bannge ba kahd ebkpatahk eko eko tete ebkpatahk bio tuulu gbo. <verse eid="JDG 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 7:14" />Owo nte we kehm-e faange re, "Nlem nyia, jol ejumjum sang, sehnge ekahngkahng bi Gidion mmon no Joas nne a Isreel. Esowo ebfaake anebe Midia, a ane kpee ba kpo tob bo ebta nok, kak Gidion go ebo." <verse eid="JDG 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 7:15" />Eji Gidion wuku nlem nyio, fere wuk ana lohngo no á tehke Esowo. Á kehm feere ba ga elsi ni abone Isreel, kehm ba ku ane."Lohngen! Lohngeno! Tibre Jehova ebfaake elsi ni anebe Midia kak-n go abo <verse eid="JDG 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 7:16" />Gidion kehm yabe nsoja atahlku nyio edi ebra. Á rodo atang nya elworo, a abon atu ba enyaale wob atahng kak nne awohng awohng go ebo. <verse eid="JDG 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 7:17" />Á kehm tongo bo re, "Seeng-m wahn." N lˈrehng kohlo n kon kon elsi, "Ajehng ajehng ji ń lˈnyehn-m n kpˈlimi, tob limen ano. <verse eid="JDG 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 7:18" />Ń lˈwuk-m, a ane ba li aname ma wor atang, tob woren, wahn kpee ji li sennge elsi nia, wahn rabe re, “Li ka Jehova, a Gidion.ˈ " <verse eid="JDG 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 7:19" />Eji Gidion a nsoja atahl alon nyi jolo a ne ma rehng go nkpe elsi nio ni anebe Midia, jolo nlum atv, eji bo ma yaange ababˈbaabe. Bo kehm kehme atang wor, fere wa abon atu ba wob bo go abo. <verse eid="JDG 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 7:20" />Owo bo kpee kehm kehme atang wor, fere wa atu ebo. No nne kehm rodo enyaale go ebobkal, ntang eboblum jo rabe re, “Ekahngkahng bi Jehova, a bi Gidion." <verse eid="JDG 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 7:21" />Nne awohng awohng yiimi edi ji bo bum-e no sennge elsi nio kak, anebe Midia kehm kehme elbeke ayambu ayambu aling aling go nnyo. <verse eid="JDG 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 7:22" />Eji nsoja atahlku nyio woro atang ebo, Jehova limi nsoja nyi anebe Midia kpee go bo elsi, bo fere jo nok atemtem go akahngkahng. Egom ji bo ki wul bo, yaame be rehng go Bet Sita mbang mbang nyio nyi Serera rehng go nseenge ejahbe nyi Abel Mehola ji li kohko Tabat. <verse eid="JDG 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 7:23" />Gidion tumu etib tv nsoja nyi Isreel nyi li go Naftali, a nyi Aser, a nyi Manase, bo lohng kpee ba kam anebe Midia. <verse eid="JDG 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 7:24" />Gidion tob tumu abatiingetib tv, ejahbe awong ji Efrem, tong bo re, "Badden, wahn ba bam anebe Midia go mbang alahb Jodan, tete rehng go Beth Bara."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 7:24">Ano wo nsoja kpee nyi Efrem lohngo no, ba taare ndi nkpe nkpe nyi aya ma Jodan, tete rehng go Beth Bara. <verse eid="JDG 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 7:25" />Bo bobo agburu anebe nsoja na abal ba anebe Midia, noko bo jo lung-e re, Oreb, noko Seeb. Oreb bo wul-e go ekpartal ji Oreb, Seeb bo wul-e go edi amahm akaame ji Seeb. Bo kame anebe Midia ekidi lˈlab, eji bo jo feere, bo ko esi Oreb, a ji Seeb ba ka Gidion . Ngare nyio á kpeka li go egbuk aya jehko.<verse eid="JDG 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JDG 8" />
  <para style="s">Gidion wulu Seba abola Salmuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 8:1" />Anebe Efrem kehm bahbe Gidion re, “Nˈnan a ma-r lim ana? A ki-r lung , eji a jo tahm elnoko a anebe Midia? Ano wo bo taange tˈtahne a Gidion <verse eid="JDG 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 8:2" />Gidion kehm faange bo re, "Anv, elkohn ejum aji m ma lˈlim sehnge jˈjahne? Ń nehme kahn re, abiini akabe greb nya sa go egbe ji Efrem nya kpˈgaka nob sehnge egbe kpee ji bo kpa no go ebangenahb ji Abiesar? <verse eid="JDG 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 8:3" />Esowo ka-n Oreb abola Seeb, atubesi anebe Midia. Jenji m ma lim, e lˈdumu, a jio ji jahne?" Eji Gidion bungu alum nyao , ntim ebo kehm naange bo. <verse eid="JDG 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 8:4" />Gidion, a nsoja atahlku enye, ba siiri Jodan, a ellahnge ellahnge ebo, bo kpe soro asi jo kam anebekv. <verse eid="JDG 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 8:5" />Eji bo rehnge go Sokot, Gidion kehm tongo anebekul Sukot re, “Ka-n nsoja enyame nsol alehke, bob gbo ewo. N kpi nkame nkame atul bao ba anebe Midia, Seba abola Salmuna. <verse eid="JDG 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 8:6" />Atubesi ba Sukot kehm-e faange re, "Wo a ka bob Seba abola Salmuna, nˈnan wahnge e bahke kake nsoja enya nsol alehke?" <verse eid="JDG 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 8:7" />Gidion kehm faange bo re, "Ebnob, Jehova lˈyake Seba abola Salmuna kak-m go ebo, m bahke koko ajoongo asohkonso, a akpiri, ba jaake agubjing enyahne. <verse eid="JDG 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 8:8" />Gidion sehnge o song rehng go ejahbe ji bo kpo lung re Peniel, tob song bahb bo nsol alehke, bo faange Gidion ana anebe Sukot faang-e no. <verse eid="JDG 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 8:9" />Á kehm bungu tong anebe Peniel re, “N lˈfeere a esehngebta ejame, m bahke wake nkahmbungubungu etahk ejahne ji ń kpo kuumu baabe ejahbe." <verse eid="JDG 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 8:10" />Ngare nyia, Seba abola Salmuna, a nsoja ebo, nyi li, ane atahltahl nkpel eltahl, a nkpel elkubal a ane atahl awubu, li go Karkor, bo ma sa go ellong nsoja nyi lohng go ero nfam. Tibre nsoja atahltahl nkpel atahlku,bob wul bo. <verse eid="JDG 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 8:11" />Gidion kehm sehnge mbang mbang jo tahm ero nfam, ajahbe nya bo jo lung re Nobah, a Jogbehah, bo song kpiri nsoja nyi anebe Midia nyi ki kunu ekpu, fere nok a bo. <verse eid="JDG 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 8:12" />Atul abal ba anebe Midia, Seba abola Salmuna be, Gidion kam bo song bob, nsoja ebo be yaame. <verse eid="JDG 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 8:13" />Eji Gidion mmona Joas ma bob bo, á kehm feere kehnge go emahng ebta, á sehnge montoora mbang no li go ewong, no bo lung re Heres. <verse eid="JDG 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 8:14" />Gidion bobo monjangkun no lohng go Sukot, á bahb-e abahbe, njankun nyio kehm yeele abing ane atahl ara, ane elku ane abal ba jolo atubesi, a anebekul Sukot, ka Gidion . <verse eid="JDG 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 8:15" />Gidion kehm feere ba rehng go Sukot, kehm ba bung tong anebe Sukot re, "Nyehnen Seba abola Salmuna gana. Wuku ń jo nyok-m re, ˈWo Seba abola Salmuna a ka bob bo, nˈnan a kpˈsebe re wahr ka nsoja enya nyi ma lahng nsol alehke?ˈ " <verse eid="JDG 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 8:16" />Á koo asohkonso, a akpiri dv anebekul bao nˈnob, jolo ana elle ka bo. <verse eid="JDG 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 8:17" />Nkahmbungubungu etahk Peniel, á wa tub, fere wul anebelum ba li ejahbe jio. <verse eid="JDG 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 8:18" />Gidion kehm bahbe Seba abola Salmuna re, "Ane ba ń wulu go Tabor, bo jolo elkohn ane abaa?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 8:18">Bo kehm-e faange re, "Bo jolo ana wo, bo foongo abone ntul.” <verse eid="JDG 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 8:19" />Gidion kehm faange bo re, “Abonanee ba o, e lohng nnyehn awohng a bo. Etingitingi, ana Jehova li go elkpin, li re ń wulem bo, kehn wahn nehm wul." <verse eid="JDG 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 8:20" />Á kehm sennge seenge mmon ewe no nkul no bo kpo lung-e re Jeta, kehm-e tongo re, "Wul bo." Jol Jeta wobem ekahngkahng ebe, tibre á jo fˈfahl eji á jolo njankun. <verse eid="JDG 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 8:21" />Seba abola Salmuna tongo Gidion re, "Á lˈjol nnenlum wul-r antahng.ˈ Ano wo Gidion soro wul bo, ane abal abal. Á yehke nsol nyi bo kpo ko liibi akamel ebo go amel.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 8:21">Gidion limi ebulungang ji nlimanjom <verse eid="JDG 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 8:22" />Abone Isreel kehm tongo Gidion re, "Wo jo fil-r, mmon ewa, a mmon a mmon ewa, tibre wo wo ma-r tahre yehke go abo nya anebe Midia." <verse eid="JDG 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 8:23" />Owo Gidion kehm faange bo re, "Me nehm jol nne no bahk-n fili, jol mmon ewame nehm jol. Jehova wo bahk-n fili! <verse eid="JDG 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 8:24" />N kpi ejum ajehng ji n kp-n bahbe, "Nong, nne awohng awohng ewahne ka-m ebangetung, nsol nyi ń da no goji anebekv ba ń ma sehnge bo." (Eljini ni anebe Ismael ni re bi jo kak abangetung nya agul). <verse eid="JDG 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 8:25" />Bo kehm faange re, "E bahke kake go eyebatahng." Owo bo kehm yale mbomo, no nne kehm koko ebangetung ba kak. Bo yehke go ellong nsol nyi bo ma da. <verse eid="JDG 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 8:26" />Ellubu ni abangetung nyao lubu no jolo ejum ekilo eltahl. Bo tob ka-e alahm lahm nsol nyako nya kpo kim ekun. Nsol ana nyia nyi bo kpo liibi, nya bo kpo kak emel, a nsol elkake nyi ntul no Midia kpo liibi, fvfo asinimel nya bo kpo kak akamel go emel. <verse eid="JDG 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 8:27" />Gidion rodo nsol nyio kpee lim ebulungang ji nlimanjom jo kak. Á song bumu ejum jia go ege ejahbe, ji bo kpo lung re Ofra. Jol gaam kang anebe Isreel kpee yake Jehova fere jo song gbo jamme alahng jo kak ebulungang jio. Fere jolo na ekpoko ka Gidion, a ebangenahb eje.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 8:27">Elkv ni Gidion <verse eid="JDG 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 8:28" />Ana wo Isreel kadde anebe Midia tv go ndi, bo kpeem tiki mehl esi emehle mehle. Go nnya atahl abal nyi Gidion kpe jol go elkpin, Isreel jolo go elkoono. <verse eid="JDG 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 8:29" />Owo Gidion (ji li Jerubaal) kehm feere kehnge go ege ejahbe. <verse eid="JDG 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 8:30" />Á bele abon atahl ara, abon awubu, ba nlum, tibre á bele akal gbalee. <verse eid="JDG 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 8:31" />Nnenkal awohng jolo go Sekem no á jo bum elkang a ne, nnenkal noo jele mmon no nlum ka-e, no bo jo lung-e re Abimelek. <verse eid="JDG 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 8:32" />Gidion mmon no Joas kpoo eji á ma sahb kˈkul. Bo song kake go eyele nde, go ejahbe ji bo kpo lung re Ofra, go ebangenahb ji Abieser. <verse eid="JDG 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 8:33" />Anebe Isreel yake Esowo, feere song kehme Baal loko ngare nyi Gidion ma kpo. Bo ko Baal Berit jol esowo ebo, fere lim alokelom enye nya bo jo kak.. <verse eid="JDG 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 8:34" />Bo yini Jehova, ye ji li Esowo ebo, ye ji ma tahre bo yehke go ellong anebekv ba sennge bo kak. <verse eid="JDG 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 8:35" />Jol bo tibem ebangenahb ji Jerubaal (ye ji li Gidion) nnoobo anyehng anyehng go anoobo nsol nya á limi ka Isreel.<verse eid="JDG 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JDG 9" />
  <para style="s">Abimelek jolo ntul go Sekem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 9:1" />Efung abehng Abimelek mmon no Gidion kehm tahme go Sekem , edi ji abonanyehn nnyehn li no, kehm song tong ejahbe nnyehn re, <verse eid="JDG 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 9:2" />"Bahben anebe Sekem, lˈjol re bo kpˈsebe re abone Gidion ba li ane atahl ara, ane awubu, ba bahke fili bo, afi nne awohng wo bahke fili bo? Buumen re, me, a wahn abonanyehn ba." <verse eid="JDG 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 9:3" />Eji abonanyehn nnyehn bungu ejum jia tong anebe Sekem, bo bumu ntir re bo bahke toono Abimelek, tibre bo bungu re, "Ye mmonannee ejahre wo." <verse eid="JDG 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 9:4" />Bo yehke akpohko go etahk elom Baal Berik, jolo akpohko esilva atahl ara, esilva ebwubu, ka Abimelek, á yaame nsoja jo toon-e. <verse eid="JDG 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 9:5" />Á mehle tahm go etahk nde ji li go Ofra, song ko afun ebe, ba jolo ane atahl ara, ane awubu ba wul bo kpee go eltal. No ga se, no bo kpo lung-e re Jotam wo be for song biiri. <verse eid="JDG 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 9:6" />Owo nfam ejahbe nyi Sekem, a Bet Milo kehm ba kono asi go egburu nnahb eti nyi li kohlo ego ji li go Sekem, re bo bob Abimelek etul. <verse eid="JDG 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 9:7" />Eji Jotam wuku bade, á kehm wahre go ewong Gerisim, kehm rabe tong anebe Sekem re, "Wuungen atung wahn anebe Sekem eji Esowo bahk-n tob wuungu atung." <verse eid="JDG 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 9:8" />Efung abehng nti kehm tahme re bo song bob ntula bo, bo gbo mbang tong eti ji bo kpo lung re Oliv re, "Jol ntul ewahre." <verse eid="JDG 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 9:9" />Á kehm tene, kehm bungu re, “Anv me n yake akehng ma n kpo lim, ma kpo ka asowo, a ane elfuula, fere jo yannge ana ntul no ntia?" <verse eid="JDG 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 9:10" />Nti kehm kpe bung tong efig, ˈBa wo ba jol ntul ewahre.ˈ <verse eid="JDG 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 9:11" />Efig kehm faange bo re, ˈAnv, me n kˈkpe kab anobonobo akab enyame fere jo yannge ana ntul no ntia? <verse eid="JDG 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 9:12" />Nti kehm ba tong elˈlehke greb, ˈBa jol ntul ewahre.ˈ <verse eid="JDG 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 9:13" />Owo elˈlehke greb kehm faange re, ˈAnv, me n kˈkpe lim amahm, ma kpo lim asowo, a ane bel eyebatahng, song yannge ana ntul no ntia?ˈ <verse eid="JDG 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 9:14" />Esˈkohro nti kehm bungu tong eti ajoongo ji ma sahb tˈtahb re, ˈBa jol ntul ewahre.ˈ <verse eid="JDG 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 9:15" />Á kehm faange bo re, ˈŃ l seb re me n jol ntul ewahne, ba woomen go egama enˈnang. Tohko jol ano, nong agun go egame song fi nti nyi li go Labenon kpee.ˈ <verse eid="JDG 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 9:16" />"Anv, wahn eblim nobnob, a ekpunu re wahn bob Abimelek, á jol ntul ewahna? Ń lˈlim nob nob ka Gidion, a ebangenahb ejea? Ń tib-e tib nnoobo eljini ana fuumu noa?. <verse eid="JDG 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 9:17" />Kana yini re, nsoo noko ka-n gbalee, eji á fili elkpin ene go ebo, tahr-n yehke go abo anebe Midia, fere ga bo. <verse eid="JDG 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 9:18" />Wo lela, ń kpˈfere nok a etahk nsoo. Abone ebe ba li ane atahl ara ane awubu, ń wulu bo go eltal anehng fere rod Abimelek ji li mmon a nju, bob-e etul ka anebe Sekem, tibre mmonanne ejahne wo. <verse eid="JDG 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 9:19" />Lˈjol re ji ń ma lim a, ń limi nobnob, a ekpunu ka Gidion a ebangenahb eje, nong Abimelek lim-n wahn bel eyebatahng, wahn tob lim-e á bel eyebatahng. <verse eid="JDG 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 9:20" />Fvfo, lˈjol re, ń limem go nseenge, nong agun lohng goji Abimelek ba fi-n, wahn anebe Sekem, a anebe Bet Milo, nong agun tob lohng go egahne wahn anebe Sekem, a anebe Bet Milo ba fi Abimelek!" <verse eid="JDG 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 9:21" />Jotam kehm beke song lene go Beer, tibre á jo fahle Abimelek mmonannyehn. <verse eid="JDG 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 9:22" />Eji Abimelek ma fili Isreel go nnya era, <verse eid="JDG 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 9:23" />Esowo kehm yake ebi etohko, ji ba yel go ellong ni atubesi anebe Sekem, a Abimelek, bo we joom kpe wuk. <verse eid="JDG 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 9:24" />Esowo limi jia, eji a lˈbongo Abimelek eji á wulu abonanyehn, ane atahl ara ane awubu ba jolo abone Gidion, fere tob bongo anebe Sekem ba tob-e no wul abonanyehn. <verse eid="JDG 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 9:25" />Anebe Sekem ba ki woomo njahma ntul tumu ane re bo song biiri go ero awong. Nne awohng awohng no lˈsehng o bo taare nsol. Nne jˈje song tooro tong Abimelek. <verse eid="JDG 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 9:26" />Ngare nyˈnehm o, Gaal mmon no Ebed mehle a abonanyehn song rehng go Sekem, ana bo je no, yebe anebe Sekem sehng, ye wo bo yehke amahr ebo kun-e. <verse eid="JDG 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 9:27" />Eji bo ma je go ebo ebgbe, song bong akab greb ba kaame, bo kehm limi elkak go etahk asowo bo. Eji bo jo li fere wˈwo, bo kehm kehme Abimelek su. <verse eid="JDG 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 9:28" />Gaal ji mmona Ebed kehm kehme elbungu re, "Nne awoo li li Abimelek? Ejum ajii wahr anebe Sekem kpi no a Abimelek, ji wahr bahk-e loko?. Ye sang li mmon no Gidiona, Sebul sang li ekpeele ejea? Nong wahr loken etˈtohngo ji Hamor ye ji li nde no Sekem . Jenji wahnge wahr bahke jolo alokeltum ba Abimelek? <verse eid="JDG 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 9:29" />Li re me wo kpˈfili ane baa, kehn m bahk-e yehke. M bahke tongo Abimelek re, ˈYehke nsoja enya kpee ba!ˈ " <verse eid="JDG 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 9:30" />Eji Sebul ji jolo ntubesi ejahbe wuku alum nya Gaal mmona Ebed bungu no, atahng rake sehng. <verse eid="JDG 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 9:31" />Á kehm tumu atiingi etib mbehr mbehr tv Abimelek go Aruma re, "Gaal mmona Ebed, a abonanyehn ebba ga Sekem, bob ba melle ane re bo kˈkpe koono a na. <verse eid="JDG 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 9:32" />N kpˈsebe re ngare atv wo, a ane eba, wahn ba biiri go mbang jo sik bo. <verse eid="JDG 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 9:33" />Efungfu, ngare nyi njul ma ta elbange, jo jeeren asongo go ejahbe. Gaal a ane ba li a ne, lˈmehl a nahne, limen bo ajehng ajehng ji ń lˈmal." <verse eid="JDG 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 9:34" />Ngare nyi atv ma behde, Abimelek a ane ebe kehm yabe elbo nlong eni, biiri kohlo Sekem. <verse eid="JDG 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 9:35" />Ngare nyi Abimelek a ane ebe ma lohng go edi ji bo biiri no Gaal yiimi go eti mbu. <verse eid="JDG 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 9:36" />Eji Gaal nyehne bo, á kehm tongo Sebul re, "Nyehn ane go kpˈbadde ewong abakae!" Sebul kehm-e faange re, "N kpˈnyehne atohko awong ana ane." <verse eid="JDG 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 9:37" />Gaal kehm kpe bung re, "Nyehn ane go kpˈlohngo abake go elka emahng, ellong nehko kpˈlohngo abake go nnahb eti nyi ane ba kpo bu mbu kpo ji. <verse eid="JDG 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 9:38" />Sebul kehm bahbe a esahb esahb re, "Nnyo mi a jo wor mehna? Wo sang bungu re, ˈNne awo li li Abimelek ji wahr bahk-e loka?ˈ Ane baa sang a jo nyok boa? Song nok a bo!" <verse eid="JDG 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 9:39" />Gaal kehm mehle a anebe Sekem, kehm kehme elnoko a Abimelek. <verse eid="JDG 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 9:40" />Abimelek kehm-e kehme elkame, anebe Sekem gbalee,jo gbo nsol jo lim bo, mbang mbang asongo go eti mbu. <verse eid="JDG 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 9:41" />Abimelek sa go Aruma, Sebul wo wo kame Gaal, a abonanyehn yehke go Sekem <verse eid="JDG 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 9:42" />Etoono efung behko anebe Sekem kpe mehl ebta, eji Abimelek wuku ano, <verse eid="JDG 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 9:43" />á kehm yabe ane ebe go nlong era, bo kehm song biiri. Eji Abimelek ma nyehn ane kpˈlohngo go ejahbe abake, bo kehm lohngo edi ji bo biiri no jo nok a bo. <verse eid="JDG 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 9:44" />Abimelek a ellong ane ebe song sahd eti mbu re anebe Sekem kˈbel mbang yel, nlong ebal nyehko jo wulu ane bako go emahng. <verse eid="JDG 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 9:45" />Efung bio kpee Abimelek noko a bo, tete á wul ane kpee, ko ejahbe. Á rannge ejahbe jio kpee, fere sale akang wohngo o. <verse eid="JDG 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 9:46" />Eji ane ba li go Sekem ba kun go nkahmbungubungu etahk ebta wuku ji ma jol, bo be song biiri go eko ebta jio ji etahk El Berith<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">El Berith abola Baal Berith ejum ajehng ji</char></note>. <verse eid="JDG 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 9:47" />Eji bo song tong Abimelek ana ane bao ma song kono edi ajehng. <verse eid="JDG 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 9:48" />Ye a nsoja enye wahre go ewong Salmon. Á rodo elfuk kiimi abˈbo nti, fere rod kunu ebahk, kehm tongo nsoja enye re, "Limen elwaare ana m ma lim a!" <verse eid="JDG 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JDG 9:49" />Ano wo ane ebe kpee kiimi abˈbo nti jo toon-e. Bo song sahde mbu mi eko ebta, kak agun tv bo go atahng. Ane kpee ba woomo etahk jio, bo rehnge ejum ane atahltahl nkpel ebal atahl awubu, anebelum, a anebkal anebkal. <verse eid="JDG 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JDG 9:50" />Abimelek kehm kpe tahm go Tebes song nok ga bo fere ko ejahbe. <verse eid="JDG 9:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JDG 9:51" />Go atahng ejahbe, nkahmbungubungu etahk ebta jolo o, ji anebelum, a anebkal, a ane kpee biiri no. Bo bame elbo tv atahng, fere song wahr go nkpake nyi jolo go ero. <verse eid="JDG 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JDG 9:52" />Eji Abimelek mehle re á song nok a bo o. Ana á jo niiri asongo, eji á ma rehng kohlo eti mbu ji etahk ebta re a song kak agun edi jio, <verse eid="JDG 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JDG 9:53" />nnenkal no kuumu go ero kehm yake mmon eltal ngoko tub Abimelek esi, esi bahnge. <verse eid="JDG 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JDG 9:54" />Abimelek kehm tongo nne no jo sol nsol ebta enye re, "Wob ekahngkahng eba wo wul-m, bo kˈbung re, ˈNnenkal wo wulu Abimelek.ˈ " Nlokeltum ewe kehm wobo ekahngkahng wul-e. <verse eid="JDG 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JDG 9:55" />Eji anebe Isreel nyehne re Abimelek ebkpo, bo kpee feere kehnge. <verse eid="JDG 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JDG 9:56" />Ana wo Esowo ko bongo Abimelek go ebi ji á limi go nlaaga nyi nde, eji á wulu ane atahl ara ane awubu, ba jolo afun ebe. <verse eid="JDG 9:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JDG 9:57" />Esowo tob bongo anebe Sekem go abˈbi ebo. Elsu ni Jotam mmon a Gidion lohko jol go etingitingi.<verse eid="JDG 9:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JDG 10" />
  <para style="s">Tola wo biingi ane arakera ba lame Isreel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 10:1" />Eji Abimelek kpo no, nne no lohng go eˈtohngo ji Isaka, no bo jo lung-e re Tola, mmon no Pua, ji jolo mmon no Dodo. Ye wo lohngo ba Isreel tahre. Ejahbe eje jolo go ejahbe awong ji Efrem, ji bo kpo lung re Samir. <verse eid="JDG 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 10:2" />Á kpoo eji á ma fili Isreel go eltahl a nnya era, bo kpa-e kak go Samir.<verse eid="JDG 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jair wo biingi ane asehma ba lame Isreel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 10:3" />Eji Tola ma kpo, Jair ji lohng go Gilied tob ba fili Isreel eltahl a nnya ebal. <verse eid="JDG 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 10:4" />Á bele eltahl abon awubu ba nlum, bo bele eltahl edonki ebwubu bi bo jo fing. Bo jo fili ejahbe ebwubu go Gilied, nya bo kpˈlungu tete sik lela re abon ajahbe ba Havot Jair. <verse eid="JDG 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 10:5" />Eji Jair kpoo no, bo kpa-e kak go Kamon.<verse eid="JDG 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elnohko ni anebe Amon jo nohk anebe Isreel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 10:6" />Abone Isreel kehm kpe lim abiafem go esamahr bi Jehova. Bo jo toono Baal, a Astarot, asowo nya anebe Aram, a anebe Sidon, a anebe Moab, a anebe Amon, a nyao nya anebe Filisia. Tib eji abone Isreel tene Jehova, bo we kpeem jo loko, <verse eid="JDG 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 10:7" />Jehova bele erakatahng a bo. Á faake bo kak go abo nya anebe Filisia, a anebe Amon. <verse eid="JDG 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 10:8" />Elya nio, bo bomo anebe Isreel go elnohko, ano wo bo nohko bo go elku nnya era, bo ji jolo go ero nfam bio bi aya ma Jodan, go Gilied ndi nyi anebe Amor <verse eid="JDG 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 10:9" />Anebe Amon tob siiri egbuk aya ma Jodan song nok a anebe Juda, a anebe Benjamin, a anebe Efrem. Anebe Isreel jolo egburu erem. <verse eid="JDG 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 10:10" />Owo anebe Isreel kehm lingi go esamahr Jehova re, "Wahr eblim abiafem bada a na, tibre e ma-a yake, fere kpˈtoono jo loko Baal." <verse eid="JDG 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 10:11" />Jehova kehm faange re, "Eji anebe Ijib, a anebe Amor, a anebe Amon, a anebe Filisia, <verse eid="JDG 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 10:12" />a anebe Sidon, a anebe Maon jo nohk-n, ń lingi no tong-m, wahn n tahr-m yehke go ebo aboa? <verse eid="JDG 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 10:13" />Ń ma-m ten, fere kpˈtoono asowo, wahn nehm kpe tahre. <verse eid="JDG 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 10:14" />Songen wahn song ling tong asowo nya ḿ ma yehke. Nong bo tahr-n yehke go egahna ntong!" <verse eid="JDG 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 10:15" />Anebe Isreel kehm kehme elgboongo Jehova re, "Wahr eblim abiafem, kak-r erem abehng abehng bi a kp-r kake, lub tahr-r anv yehke go ebo abo." <verse eid="JDG 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 10:16" />Anebe Isreel kehm roko asowo ebo kpee go fere jo loko Jehova, kehm-e kehme eltim gbiingi go erem bi anebe Isreel kpˈnyehne. <verse eid="JDG 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 10:17" />Eji anebe Amon mehle ebta, ba gba ji go Gilied. Anebe Isreel tob lohngo ba gba ji go Mispa. <verse eid="JDG 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 10:18" />Atubesi ba Gilied kehm bungu tong atemtem re, "Nne no lˈgbo mbang mehl song nok ebta a anebe Amon, ye wo bahke jolo ntubesi ka ane kpee ba lene go Gilied."<verse eid="JDG 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JDG 11" />
  <para style="s">Jefta, wo biingi ane anehkeni ba Lame Isreel.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 11:1" />Ngare nyio egburu etahntahn nne jolo go Gilied no bo jo lung-e re Jefta. Nde bo jo lung-e re Gilied; Nnyehn jolo nne asˈsa. <verse eid="JDG 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 11:2" />Nkal no Gilied tob jele abon ba nlum ka-e, ngare nyi bo ma gbal, bo kehm kame Jefta nfun abo yehke go ebo ellong. Bo kehm bungu tong-e re, "A nehm tiki sa a, ba li elkv nsoo a nahre, tibre nne no jel-a no nne asˈsa wo." <verse eid="JDG 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 11:3" />Owo Jefta kehm soro be goji afun ebe tahm go ndi nyi Tob, go wo á song bel ellong atahnsi ane ba ki bel ejum ajehng ajehng ji ellimi.<verse eid="JDG 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 11:4" />Eji ma kang abon afung ntiil, anebe Amon kehm ba kehme elnoko a anebe Isreel. <verse eid="JDG 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 11:5" />Anebekul nfam ba Gilied kehm tahme go ndi nyi Tob re bo song ko Jefta. <verse eid="JDG 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 11:6" />Bo kehm song tong-e re, "Ba wo ba jol ntˈtohko ewahre wahr song nok a anebe Amon."<verse eid="JDG 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 11:7" />Jefta kehm faange bo re, "Me wahn korem, owo wahnge ń kam-m go nlaaga nyi nsoo. Nˈnan ḿ bahke bake go egame anv, eji ń wob go ntong?"<verse eid="JDG 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 11:8" />Bo kehm-e faange re, "Jio ki-a gbiingi anv, wahr ebfeere ba re wo ba tob-r nok a anebe Amon. Á bahke jolo ntubesi no anebe Gilied kpee."<verse eid="JDG 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 11:9" />Jefta faange bo re, "Lˈjol re wahn ebfeere aname re me song nok a anebe Amon, Jehova faake abo kak-m go ebo, m bahke lohko jol ntubesi ewahna?"<verse eid="JDG 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 11:10" />Bo kehm-e faange re, "Wahr ebnyam re e bahke limi ana a bungu no, Jehova li ntianse enyahre." <verse eid="JDG 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 11:11" />Owo Jefta tahme toono anebekul nfam a Gilied, bo lim-e a jol ntubesi no jo gbo bo mbang go ebta. Go Mispa Jefta kpe bung nsol nyia kpee go esamahr bi Jehova nyi á bungu tong anebekul ejahbe.<verse eid="JDG 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 11:12" />Jefta kehm tumu abatiingetib tv ntul no Amon re á seb kahn ji wahng ka á ma bom abohng a anebe Isreel.<verse eid="JDG 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 11:13" />Ntul no Amon kehm faange abatiingetib bao re, "Ngare nyi Isreel lohngo go Ijib, bo taare ndi enyahre, bomo go aya ma Amon tete song rehng go aya ma Jobok, mbang mbang asongo go Jordan. Anv, feeren anyi ka-r enangebeem."<verse eid="JDG 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 11:14" />Jefta kehm tumu eltib tv ntul no Amon, <verse eid="JDG 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 11:15" />"Ji ji a ji Jefta kpˈbungu: Ndi nyi Moab, afii nyi anebe Amon, Isreel taarem. <verse eid="JDG 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 11:16" />Ngare nyi bo lohngo go Ijib, bo sehnge elka emahng asongo go Abili Aya tete song rehng go Kadesh. <verse eid="JDG 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 11:17" />Bo tumu eltib tv ntul no Edom re á lub fa bo nnyo bo sehng go ege ejahbe, á taamem. Ano wo bo tob bahb ntul no Moab, á tob ten. Isreel ba sa go Kadesh.<verse eid="JDG 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 11:18" />"Isreel sehnge nkpe nkpe nyio nyi elka emahng nio ni Edom abola Moab, bo sehnge ero nfam, ero nfam nyio nyi Moab, song rehng go nkpe aya ma Anon. Bo tikem siiri aya ma Anon rehng Moab tib o wo nkona ndi jolo no.<verse eid="JDG 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 11:19" />"Isreel kehm tumu eltib tv Sihon ntul no anebe Amor, ye ji kuumu go Hesbon re, ˈÁ fa bo nnyo bo sehng go ege ejahbe song rehng edi ji bo fi no.ˈ<verse eid="JDG 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 11:20" />Sihon, taamem tv bo re bo sehng go ege ejahbe. Á toobo nsoja enye bum go Jahas nyi jo nok a Isreel.<verse eid="JDG 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 11:21" />"Jehova, ye ji li Esowo bi Isreel, yake Sihon, a ane ebe kak Isreel abo. Ndi nyio nyi anebe Amor lene no kpee. <verse eid="JDG 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 11:22" />Anebe Isreel ko edi ndi, bomo go aya ma Anon song rehng go aya ma Jabok, sehng o rehng go elka emahng tete rehng go Jodan.<verse eid="JDG 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 11:23" />"Eji Jehova, Esowo bi Isreel ma kam anebe Amor, taare ndi abo ka Isreel. Jenji wahng ka á kpˈsebe re wahr rod ka-a? <verse eid="JDG 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 11:24" />Anv á nehm ko ji Kemosh, esowo eba ka-a noa? Ano wo fvfo ji Jehova, Esowo ebahre ka-r no, ji ji e bahke koko. <verse eid="JDG 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 11:25" />Anv, wo wo ga nob sehnge Balak mmon no Sippo ji ntul no Moaba? Á tˈtaange a Isreela, afi nok a bo? <verse eid="JDG 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 11:26" />Nyehn ejum nnya atahlku ma sehng, nyi Isreel ma lene go ndi nyia, bomo go Hesbon rehng go Aroer, a ajahbe kpee nya li go nkpe aya nyi Anon. Nnya nnya nyia kpee nˈnan a kala ko ndi nyia wuku wuku. <verse eid="JDG 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 11:27" />Me, n wa ka soodo, á kp-m limi ebi anv ebta bi a ma-r bohko. Nong Jehova, ye ji li nlˈlame no nno, toobo ntong nyia ka-r lela." <verse eid="JDG 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 11:28" />Etib bi Jefta tumu tv ntul no Amon, jol we lubem. <verse eid="JDG 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 11:29" />Owo, Etohko ji Jehova kehm ba yel Jefta, á kehm yele go atahng ejahbe nya Gilied, Manase, a Mispa ji li go Gilied, song ku nsoja nyi bahke noko a anebe Amon. <verse eid="JDG 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 11:30" />Jefta kehm koko nwongo go esamahr Jehova re, "A lˈka-m esehngebta go esamahr anebe Amon, <verse eid="JDG 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 11:31" />ejum ajehng ajehng ji gbo mbang lohng go egame etahk ba wan-m, eji m ma nok ebta ga anebe Amon, bahke jolo ji Jehova, m bahk-e rodo lim njom nyio nyi bo kpo jahm fi." <verse eid="JDG 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 11:32" />Jefta kehm tahme song nok a anebe Amon, Jehova rodo bo kak-e go ebo. <verse eid="JDG 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 11:33" />Á rannge ejahbe na eltahl, bomo go Aroer tete rehng go Minit, sehng rehng go Abel Keramim. Ana wo Isreel ga anebe Amon. <verse eid="JDG 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 11:34" />Re Jefta feere rehng etahk, mmon mmon awohng ewe no nkal wo lohngo ba wan-e, fere jo bahn ase nya bo jo kub. Ki li ye mmon awohng awohng noko á belem. <verse eid="JDG 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 11:35" />Eji Jefta nyehn-e no, á kehm jabbe nsol ebjing nyˈnye yare, fere biingi tiim, "Mmon ewame, eltim ename ebrannge kpee eji á lohngo ba wan-m. Me n nyam enyam tong Jehova bi n lˈkˈma kane." <verse eid="JDG 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 11:36" />Mmon kehm faange re, "Nsoo wobnyam tong Jehova, rod-m lim ana a nyame no. Eji ntul Esowo ma-a ka esehngebta go esamahr anebe Amon, ba li anebekv eba. <verse eid="JDG 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 11:37" />Tohko lim ejum ajehng jia ka-m ji n kpˈsebe, "Me n song yannge a ate ebame go ero awong, ling a bo ejum nnyahng ebal, tibre n nehm tiki kpe bal nlum." <verse eid="JDG 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 11:38" />Á kehm-e fake nnyo re á song, "Song yannge a ate ebe go nnyahng ebal." Ate ebe kehm-e toono rehng go ero ewong, song ling a ne, tibre á nehm tiki bal nlum. <verse eid="JDG 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 11:39" />Eji nnyahng ebal mio ma mal, á kehm feere ba goji nde, á rod-e lim ana á nyame no. Á sa mmongungu. Ana wo eljini ni Isreel fere jol, <verse eid="JDG 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 11:40" />go elya anehng anehng abongungu anebkal jo lohngo go nfung eni song buumu bada mmon a Jefta ji lohng go Gilied.<verse eid="JDG 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JDG 12" />
  <para style="s">Anebe Efrem noko a Jefta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 12:1" />Anebe Efrem kehm song melle nsoja ebo, siiri song rehng go Safon. Bo kehm tumu etib bia tv Jefta re, "Jenji wahnge a kehm-r sehnge sa song nok a anebe Amon, a ki-r lung re wahr ba tob-a nok a bo? E bahke jahme etahk eja, a na na fi." <verse eid="JDG 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 12:2" />Jefta kehm faange re, "Me a ane ebame jo noko egburu enok a anebe Amon, n lung-n lung, m m-e tahrem yehke go ebo abo. <verse eid="JDG 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 12:3" />Eji n sebe kahn re ḿ m-e nehm tob, n rodo elkpin ename go egame abo, siiri song nok a anebe Amon. Jehova ka-m ka esehnge ebta, n ga bo. Jenji wahnge ń yahke ba nok aname lela?" <verse eid="JDG 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 12:4" />Owo Jefta kehm lungu anebe Gilied bo ba kono edi ajehng, kehm song nok a anebe Efrem. Anebe Gilied kehm wulu na wul anebe Efrem, tibre anebe Efrem ebbung re, "Wahn anebe Gilied, ń li na ane ba Efrem abola Manase ma ten." <verse eid="JDG 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 12:5" />Anebe Gilied ba taare elga ni bo jo siiri rehng go Efrem,edi ji kil ga rahbe, go aya ma Jodan. Nne Efrem no kpˈbeke lˈba elsiiri, anebe Gilied bahk-e sahde go mbang, fere bahb-e re," Wo nne a Efrem woa?" Á lˈfaange re "Eˈee," <verse eid="JDG 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 12:6" />bo bahk-e tongo re, "Ebnob," lung re, "Siboled.ˈ " Á lˈfere lung re Siyiboled, tib eji á ki ma lung nobnob, bo bahk-e bobo song wul go elga Jodan. Anebe Efrem ba kpo ngare nyio jolo ane atahltahl nkpel atahl alon, a nkpel elon. <verse eid="JDG 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 12:7" />Jefta ji lohng go Gilied fili Isreel nnya erakera, kehm kpoko, bo kpa-e kak go Gilied.<verse eid="JDG 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibsan wo biingi ane asehmwubu ba fili Isreel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 12:8" />Eji Jefta ma kpo owo Ibsan ji lohng go Betlehem bomo Isreel go elfili. <verse eid="JDG 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 12:9" />Abone ebe ba nlum jolo eltahl abon awubu, ba nkal jolo eltahl abon awubu fvfo. Á rodo abon ebe ba nkal tang abangenahb nyandiki. Á tob ko agbahme go abangenahb nyako ba ka abone ebe ba nlum. Ibsan fili Isreel go nnya esehma. <verse eid="JDG 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 12:10" />Elkohro, Ibsan kehm kpoko, bo kp-e kak go Betlehem. <verse eid="JDG 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 12:11" />Eji Ibsan kpo no, Elon ji lohng go Sebulon bomo Isreel go elfili. Á fili Isreel go nnya ewubu. <verse eid="JDG 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 12:12" />Elon kehm tob kpo, bo kpa-e kak go Aijalon ji li ndi nyi Sebulon. <verse eid="JDG 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 12:13" />Eji Elon kpo no, Abdon mmon no Hilel ji lohng go Piraton, bomo Isreel go ellame. <verse eid="JDG 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 12:14" />Á bele abon atahl abal ba nlum, abon abon ebe jolo eltahl abon awubu, bo jo kuumu go ebvankang bi jolo atahl ara ewubu. Á lame Isreel go nnya enehkeni. <verse eid="JDG 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 12:15" />Abdon mmon no Hilel kehm kpoko, bo kpa-e kak go Piraton ji li go Efrem, ejahbe ewong ji anebe Amalek.<verse eid="JDG 12:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JDG 13" />
  <para style="s">Ana wo bo jele Samson</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 13:1" />Anebe Isreel kehm kpe lim abˈbi go esamahr bi Jehova, á kehm faake bo kak Filisia go abo, go nnya atahl abal. <verse eid="JDG 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 13:2" />Nne awohng jolo go no bo kpo lung-e re Manoa, á lohng go Sora ji li go elwo Dan. Nkal ewe jolo ngum, mmon awohng awohng á jelem. <verse eid="JDG 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 13:3" />Efung abehng enjel nyi Jehova kehm lohngo ba go ege kehm ba tong-e re, "A li ngum, mmon awohng awohng a kpimm. A bahke sake ela jel mmon no nlum. <verse eid="JDG 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 13:4" />Ka wo amahm ewoko woko, jol ejum elwoko ajehng ajehng ji kpo lim, ka tob li ejum ajehng ajehng ji ki li saang, <verse eid="JDG 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 13:5" />tibre a bahke sake ela jel mmon no nlum. A nehm kun-e elsem go ege esi, tibre bo bahk-e rodo kak Esowo go ebo. Bomo efung bi bo jel-e no, bo bahke koko nwongo re á bahke jolo eje eje ka Esowo. Á bahke tahre Isreel yehke go abo nya Filisia." <verse eid="JDG 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 13:6" />Nnenkal noa kehm soro mehl song kpiri nlum we, kehm-e tongo re, "Nne Esowo awohng baa ba kpir-m, á jolo are enjel nyi Esowo nyi, nne lˈseeng-e á bahke bele elfahle. We m bahbem edi ji á lohng no ba, jol mbing enye á me-e tongem. <verse eid="JDG 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 13:7" />Á bungu aname re, ˈA bahke sake ela jel mmon no nlum. Bomo anv asongo, ka tiki wo amahm ewoko woko, a ejum ajehng ajehng ji ma mang ji bo kpo wo, fvfo ka tiki li ejum ji ki li saang, tibre mmon no nlum no a bahke jele bahke jolo mmon no bo ma lim nwongo re bo bahk-e rodo á jol eje eje ka Esowo, bomo go efung bi bo bahk-e jele tete á kpo.ˈ " <verse eid="JDG 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 13:8" />Owo Manoa kehm kake ero tong Jehova re, "Nsoo, n kp-a gboongo , lub lim nne Esowo noo kpe feere ba, ba tib-r ana e bahke fili mmon noa no e bahke jele." <verse eid="JDG 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 13:9" />Esowo kehm faange Manoa. Enjel nyi Esowo kehm kpe ba kpiri nnenkal noa eji á li go egbe. Manoa nlum we jolem o a ne. <verse eid="JDG 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 13:10" />Nnenkal noa kehm beke song lung nlum re, "Nne no ba tiing-m etib nyanjehle, yeb kpe ba." <verse eid="JDG 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 13:11" />Manoa kehm feere toono nkal, ba kpiri nnenlum noo, kehm-e bahbe re, "Wo ba bung a nkal ewame nyanjehla?" Á kehm faange Manoa re, "Me wo." <verse eid="JDG 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 13:12" />Manoa kehm-e bahbe re, "Anv, alum nya a ma-r tong lˈlohko jol ano, e bahke jo fili mmon noa renan, eltum anii á bahke jo lim?" <verse eid="JDG 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 13:13" />Enjel nyi Jehova kehm faange Manoa re, "Lim eji nkal ewa lˈtoono ajehng ajehng ana m me-e tong." <verse eid="JDG 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 13:14" />Á kˈtiki li ejum ajehng ajehng ji lohng go nlehke avain, á kˈwo amahm amehng amehng, afi ejum ajehng ajehng ji ma mang, jol á kˈli ejum ajehng ajehng ji ki li saang. Nong á tiki bum ajehng ajehng ji n tong-e re á bum. <verse eid="JDG 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 13:15" />Manoa kehm bungu tong enjel nyi Jehova re, "Ji a wahr tohko song wul mbul, lam nsol ka-a." <verse eid="JDG 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 13:16" />Enjel nyi Jehova kehm-e faange re, "Jol afi a bob-m na bum a, n nehm tiki li ejum alehke eja. A lˈfere toobo re wo lim njom nyi bo kpo jahm na fi, lim ka Jehova." <verse eid="JDG 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 13:17" />Manoa kehm bahbe enjel nyi Jehova re, "Mbing enya mee? Eji ejum ji a ma-r tong lˈjol ano e lˈkpun-a." <verse eid="JDG 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 13:18" />Owo enjel nyi Jehova kehm-e tongo re, "Nˈnan a kpˈbahbe mbing enyame, n lˈtong-a a nehm kahn." <verse eid="JDG 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 13:19" />Manoa kehm koko mombul, a ayare nya nkohl, kehm song lim njom go ekpartal ka Jehova. Jehova limi nkpokosi ejum ji Manoa abola nkal jo seenge: <verse eid="JDG 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 13:20" />Ana agun jo lohng go edi njom, mehle tortor ton esi go elbung, enjel nyi Jehova tob mehl toono ebliki agun asongo go elbung. Eji Manoa a nkal nyehne ano bo gboko kohk asamahr ebo go ndi. <verse eid="JDG 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 13:21" />Eji enjel nyio ki kpe feere ba goji Manoa abola nkal, owo Manoa ba kahn re enjel nyi Jehova nyi. <verse eid="JDG 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 13:22" />Manoa kehm tongo nkal ewe re, "E bahke kpokao, tibre wahr ebnyehn Esowo!" <verse eid="JDG 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 13:23" />Owo nkal kehm-e faange re, "Li re Jehova sebe re á wul-r, kehn á jolem koko ayare nya bo kpo jahm fi, a nya nkohl go egahre abo, jol á wahr jolem tibi nsol nyia, fere tob tong-r nsol nyia." <verse eid="JDG 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 13:24" />Nnenkal noo kehm jele mmon no nlum, kehm-e kake mbing re Samson. Mmon noo kehm gbale, elfuulu ni Jehova jolo a ne. <verse eid="JDG 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 13:25" />Etohko ji Jehova kehm kehme ellimi eltum go ege elkpin eji á jolo go Mahane Dan, go elka elka no Sora abola Estaol.<verse eid="JDG 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JDG 14" />
  <para style="s">Elbal ni Samson</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 14:1" />Efung abehng, Samson je go Timna, song nyehn ngbahme, á jolo nne a Filisia. <verse eid="JDG 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 14:2" />Eji Samson feere ba rehng etahk, á ba tongo nde abola nnyehn re, "Me n nyehn mmon a Filisia no nkal go Timna, koon ye ka-m, á jol nkal ewame." <verse eid="JDG 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 14:3" />Nde abola nnyehn kehm-e faange re, "Anv, nnenkal awohng awohng a nyehnem go ellong akunu enyahre, a ane ebahre kpeea? Jenji wahnge a bahke tahme goji anebe Filisia ba kˈlˈyehke nrur song seb nkal? Samson kehm tongo nde re, "Ko-e ka-m, ye wo n kpe-e sebe." <verse eid="JDG 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 14:4" />(Jol nde abola nnyehn kahnem re Jehova kpˈsebe na mbang nyi á bahke koko ntong ba ka Filisia, tib ngare nyio bo ba jo fili Isreel). <verse eid="JDG 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 14:5" />Samson tahme go Timna, a nde, go nnyehn, eji bo rehnge edi egbe agreb ji anebe Timna. Owo egabe kehm ba kehme elnoko a Samson. <verse eid="JDG 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 14:6" />Ngare nyˈnehm o, Etohko ji Jehova kehm ba yel-e fere ka-e nsahm á kehm jabbe egabe yare abo abo, are á yare mombul. Jol nde abola nnyehn a tongem bo ji á ma lim. <verse eid="JDG 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 14:7" />Eji Samson song rehng go Timna, á kehm song bung a nnenkal. Samson nnenkal noo jo kor-e kor. <verse eid="JDG 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 14:8" />Eji ma kang abon afung, á kehm feere re á song lim elbal ebo, á kehm yange go ekul re á song nyehn ekpakv egabe jio. Á song nyehne ekon ma yel o, bi ma lim akehng, <verse eid="JDG 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 14:9" />á sa o kehme, rod abo song raabe akehng ekon jo yab mbang mbang. Eji á song kpiri nde abola nnyehn, á kehm tob ka bo, bo yab. Á tongem bo re akehng ekon mao lohng go ekpakv egabe. <verse eid="JDG 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 14:10" />Ana nde tahme song kpiri nnenkal, ano wo Samson song lim elkak ana eljini ajangkun jolo no ngare nyi bo kpˈlimi elbal ebo. <verse eid="JDG 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 14:11" />Eji Samson ba no anebe Timna ka-e eltahl atem awubu ba bahke jo jen a ne. <verse eid="JDG 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 14:12" />Samson kehm bungu re, Tong-m wahn ana elgan nia lohngo no. Ń lˈtong-m go nfung esehma nyi elkak nia bahke jolo, m bahk-n kake eltahl ebehn ebwubu, a eltahl a mbomo ewubu. <verse eid="JDG 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 14:13" />Ń tohkem ma tong ana lohngo no, ḿ bahk-m kake eltahl ebehn ebwubu, a eltahl ajoobo abomo ewubu. Bo kehm-e tongo re, "Tong-r elgan ena." <verse eid="JDG 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 14:14" />Á kehm bungu re, "Nsol alehke eblohng goji nne no kpo li, go etahntahn edi nnyebeyebe ejum eblohng." Go nfung era kohro kohro, bo maam tiki kahn ana lohngo lohng. <verse eid="JDG 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 14:15" />Eji ma biingi nfung eni, bo kehm tongo nkala Samson re, "Leebe nlum wa á tong-a, wo ba tong-r elgan ni á tong-r no. Tohko jol ano e bahk-a fehke a ane kpee ba li go etahk nso. Anv, ń tiing-r na elkak re wahr ba gbo ekpaka? <verse eid="JDG 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 14:16" />Owo nkala Samson kehm bake a abonngo go amahr, kehm tongo nlum re, "N wa nehme kor, n kp-a sabe! Wob tub ane ebame elgan, m-e a tong-m ana lohngo no. Á kehm-e faange re, "Jol nsoo abola nnee n ka tong bo, jenji wahnge m bahk-a tongo?" <verse eid="JDG 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 14:17" />Ano ano wo nkal jo ling go nfung esehma nyi elkak nio. Esˈkohro efung bi biingi nfung esehma á kehm-e tongo tibre á gbiing-e sehng. Ano wo á feere no song tong ane ebe. <verse eid="JDG 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 14:18" />Ntuumu nyi elgung esˈkohro efung bio, afono ejahbe bao kehm ba tong-e re, "Ejum aji kpˈyebe sehnge akehng ekon? Jenji kpˈtahne sehnge egabe? "Samson kehm bungu tong bo re, "Ki li re wahn, a nne no li badbad a name, kehn ḿ m-e jolem ma tong ana elgan ename lohngo no." <verse eid="JDG 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 14:19" />Etohko ji Jehova kehm ba yele fere ka- nsahm, á kehm song rehng go Askelon, song wul eltahl ane awubu go ejahbe jio, fere taare bo nsol ebo kpee. Á koo abomo ane bao, ba ka ane ba tong-e ana elgan nio lohngo no. Eji ma jol ano, rake Samson atahng sehng, á soro mehl o kehnge etahk nde. <verse eid="JDG 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 14:20" />Nkala Samson bo rod-e ka ekpondahme Samson ji jolo o elkak.<verse eid="JDG 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JDG 15" />
  <para style="s">Samson song bongo anebe Filisia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 15:1" />Eji ma kang abon afung ntiil, ngare nyi kpo banne nkohl, Samson kehm rodo mmona mbul, tahm re á song nyehn nkal ewe. Á tongo nde nkal re á kpˈsebe re á song kang a nkal ewe. Nde nkal taamem. <verse eid="JDG 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 15:2" />Nde nkal kehm-e tongo re, "N tiri re, á wa nehme kor, n rod-e ka ekpondahme eja. Nyehn mmonannyehn no nse, ye wo kpˈgaka nob, feere wo ba ko ye go elbal." <verse eid="JDG 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 15:3" />Samson kehm bungu re, "Anv, Nnene m-e nehm ma ka ebi ajehng ajehng, n lˈlim Filisia ebi." <verse eid="JDG 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 15:4" />Samson kehm lohngo song bob mbehr atahlku, jabbe ebbal ebbal go eboa nsil kanne, á tob jo gbade nkahr semme go eboa nsil ebal ebal. <verse eid="JDG 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 15:5" />Á kehm kake agun go nkahr nyio, fere yake bo, bo jo be go atahng egbe nkohl ji anebe Filisia. Ano wo á limi no fi nkohl nyi anebe Filisia kpee wohng go ndi, a nya bo gba agan agan. Bo tob rannge ebgbe agreb, a ebgbe oliv kpee. <verse eid="JDG 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 15:6" />Anebe Filisia kehm bahbe re, "Nne awo limi ejum jia?" Bo kehm faange bo re, "Samson wo, ye ji ko mmon no nne a Timna, tibre bo m-e taare nkal ka nte ewe. Anebe Filisia kehm tahme song jahm nnenkal noo, a nde fi go agun. <verse eid="JDG 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 15:7" />Samson kehm bungu tong bo re, ˈˈEji ḿ ma lim ana, n nehm tiki rahke tete m bong-n kpee biing-m." <verse eid="JDG 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 15:8" />Á mehle a egburu erakatahng song nok a bo, wul ane gbalee. Á mehle song woomo go nkpaltal nyio go Etam. <verse eid="JDG 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 15:9" />Anebe Filisia kehm ba bum elsi ebo go Juda, bo nyange elsi ebo rehng go Lehi. <verse eid="JDG 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 15:10" />Anebe Juda kehm bahbe anebe Filisia re, "Jenji wahnge ḿ ma ba elnoko a nahre?" Bo kehm faange bo re, "E ba re wahr ba bob Samson, fere bong-e ana ji á ma-r lim." <verse eid="JDG 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 15:11" />Ane atahltahl nkpel esehma, ane atahl awubu ba Juda kehm tahme song kpiri Samson go nkpaltal nyi jolo go ewong ji Etam. Bo tongo Samson re, "Á nehme kahn re Filisia ji kp-r fila? Jenji a kp-r limi ana?" Samson kehm faange bo re, "Elbongo ni m bongo bo." <verse eid="JDG 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 15:12" />Bo kehm tongo Samson re, "E ba re wahr ba gba-a, rod-a song faake kak anebe Filisia go abo." Samson kehm bungu re, "Nyamen tong-m re, wahn m-e nehm wul antahng." <verse eid="JDG 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 15:13" />Bo kehm-e faange re, "E wa nehm wul, e bahk-a gbake na gba abo, faak-a kak bo abo." Bo kehm gbake Samson go alehke nfenfe na abal, lohng a ne go nkpaltal nyio. <verse eid="JDG 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 15:14" />Eji anebe Filisia ba rehng a Samson go Lehi, bo kehm kimi abohk, jo rabe ana bo m-e bel. Etohko ji Jehova kehm ba ko nji go ege elkpin ba ka-e eko. alehke nya bo gba-e no kehm geebe are ngbakehrebo nyi, lohng-e go abo gbo. <verse eid="JDG 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 15:15" />Á kehm soro lamme rod elyar mbvankang nyi noongo go ndi, nyi bo kpehn-e wulu, wul ane atahltahl nkpel ebal atahl awubu ba Filisia. <verse eid="JDG 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 15:16" />Samson kehm bungu re, "A elyar enyˈnya go egame ebo, me n wul bo bum abim abim. A elyar mbvankang me n ko wul ane atahltahl nkpel ebal atahl awubu." <verse eid="JDG 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 15:17" />Eji á ma bung ano kpee mal, á kehm roko elyar mbvankang nyio go. Bo gungu edi jio mbing re, Ramat-Lehi. (ji lohngo re ewong elyar nnyam) <verse eid="JDG 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 15:18" />Eji alahb m-e kor, á kehm rabe lung Jehova re, "Wob nok ebta bia sehng go abo nya nlokeltum ewa. Anv, me n kpo ekor lahba, fooro yel abo ane ba kˈlˈyehke nrura?" <verse eid="JDG 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 15:19" />Jehova kehm limi alahb lohng go elbing anehng go Lehi, ana Samson wo no , ano wo á feere bel eko ana wuku wuku. Bo jo lungu elbing alahb nio re En Hakore (lohngo re elbing alahb ni nne lingi no ane wuk). <verse eid="JDG 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 15:20" />Samson lame Isreel go nnya eltahl, ngare nyio anebe Filisia ba jo fili edi.<verse eid="JDG 15:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JDG 16" />
  <para style="s">Samson abola Delila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 16:1" />Efung abehng Samson tahme song rehng go Gasa. Á song nne asˈsa awohng soro bum elkang a ne. <verse eid="JDG 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 16:2" />Etib kehm rehnge anebe Gasa re Samson li o. Anebe Gasa kehm gbake elbo toobo bum nnyo amehng re bo song biiri go eti mbu jo sik-e. Bo jolo o soom atv atv mao kpee, jo bung re efunfu lˈba elseke, e bahk-e wulu. <verse eid="JDG 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 16:3" />Samson noongo o tete atv kul. Á kehm mehle song melle ati mbu nya ejahbe, ebbal ebbal, a mbil a mbil enye. Á melle kunu go ebahk, sol song kunu go ero ewong ji li mbuksong nyi Hebron. <verse eid="JDG 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 16:4" />Eji ma kang abon afung, Samson ba bele nnenkal go ejahbe ji jolo edamme ji bo kpo lung re Sorek. Bo jo lung-e re Delila. <verse eid="JDG 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 16:5" />Owo atubesi anebe Filisia kehm bungu tong Delila re, "Were Samson á tong-a edi ji eko eje behr no, eji e bahk-e ma ko elfono, fere gba-e, taare eko eje. Nne awohng awohng ewahre bahk-a kake ebahk asilva atahltahl nkpel ebal, ebahk atahlku. <verse eid="JDG 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 16:6" />Efung abehng Delila kehm tongo Samson re, “Tong-m ejum ji kpo ka-a elkohn eko ana jia, tob tong-m ana nne bahk-a ma gba ko-a elfono.” <verse eid="JDG 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 16:7" />Samson kehm-e faange re, "A lˈko nlehke na esehma bi mbir mbir gba-m, m bahke fere jol ana nne noka noka." <verse eid="JDG 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 16:8" />Owo anebekul Filisia kehm koko alehke mbir mbir nyao na esehma ba ka Delila, á rod gba-e. <verse eid="JDG 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 16:9" />Ane biiri o ekpˈkpa ajehng etahk jio. Delila kehm rabe, "Samson, anebe filista ma-a ba elbo bao! Samson tohngo na tohng alehke nyao were na were go abo, are bo tono nlehke mio go agun. Edi ji eko eje behr no bo kahnem. <verse eid="JDG 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 16:10" />Delila kehm tongo Samson re, "Á kp-m koko na lim mbene, fere kp-m tongo afahnge. Titi anv, tong-m ana m bahk-a ma gba, fere ko-a elfono." <verse eid="JDG 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 16:11" />Samson kehm-e faange re, "Bo lˈgba-m alehke nfenfe nya bo kala kˈko gba ejum, m bahke jolo ana nne noka noka." <verse eid="JDG 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 16:12" />Owo Delila kehm koko alehke nfenfe ba a nya ba gba-e. Eji ane ba biiri go ekpˈkpa ana bo biiri ngare nyehko wuku Delila ma rabe, "Samson, anebe Filisia ma-a ba elbo bao." Samson tohng alehke nyao kiimi go ege abo are av nya. <verse eid="JDG 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 16:13" />Delila kehm bungu tong Samson re, "Tete rehng anv, a kpˈlimi na mbene aname, fere jo tong-m afahnge! Tong-m ana m bahk-a gbake . " Á kehm faange re, "A lˈtahng alvsi na esehma fere fer go ejum ji bo kpo tub abomo, fere kahn ekud, m bahke jolo ana nne noka noka. Eji á jo lal, Delila kehm ba tahng alv asehma nyao fere tub, <verse eid="JDG 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 16:14" />fere kahn ekpud, bade go ejum, tub abomo baade tv. Owo Delila kehm kpe rabe lung-e, "Samson, anebe Filisia ma-a ba elbobao!" Á kehm yahme go ellu, wob nga nyio nyi bo baade alv esi tv go edi ji kpo tub abomo. <verse eid="JDG 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 16:15" />Delila kehm-e tongo re, ˈJenji wahnge a kpˈbungu re, "N kp-a koro, eji a kalem tong nsol nyi behr-a go eltim? Anv, eblim nkpel era nyi a ma-m nehm. A ma-m ten eltongo edi ji egburu eko eja behr no. <verse eid="JDG 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 16:16" />Ano wo efung abehng abehng á jo gbiing-e tete á lahng fere jo yam go ngbˈgbiingi nyi á kp-e gbiingi. <verse eid="JDG 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 16:17" />Esˈkohro Samson lennge ejum ajehng ajehng ka-e, kehm-e tongo re, "Alv esi enyame bo ka kˈkiimi go esem. Tibre n li eje eje ka Esowo, bomo eji bo jel-m no. Bo lˈkiimi alv esi enyame, eko ejame bahke lohngo. M bahke jolo ana ane baka baka." <verse eid="JDG 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 16:18" />Eji Delila sebe kahn re á me-e tong etingitingi, á kehm tumu etib tv atubesi Filisia re, "Kpe-n feere ba anv, á ma-m tong ejum ajehng ajehng. Ana bo ba no, bo ba a akpohko nya bo taame no. <verse eid="JDG 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 16:19" />Delila kehm were Samson lal-e go ayo. Á kehm lungu nne ba yel, no ba kpud-e alv esi enye, ano wo eko eje gbodo no, soro yak-e abo. <verse eid="JDG 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 16:20" />Owo Delila kehm rabe re, "Samson anebe Filisia ma-a ba elbobao! Á nyahme kan a me, "Á kehm tiri re, a bahke lohngo ana á kpo kono ellohngo wuku wuku, gbehre eje for. Jol á tikem kahn re Jehova m-e yake abo. <verse eid="JDG 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 16:21" />Owo anebe Filisia kehm-e bobo, luud-e amahr, rod-e tahm go Gasa. Bo kak-e afarebok abrons go abo, fere bum-e á jo gok nsol go ngbekobo go eltal ngoko. <verse eid="JDG 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 16:22" />Eji ma abon afung, esi ji bo m-e kpud kehm kehme elkohdo.<verse eid="JDG 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elkv ni Samson</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 16:23" />Atubesi Filisia kehm ba gba ji, ba lim egburu elkak ni bo bahke limi egburu njom ka Dagon ji jolo esowo ebo, fere geere re, "Esowo ebahre ebga Samson nnekv ewahre, faak-e kak-r go abo." <verse eid="JDG 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 16:24" />Ana ane nyehn-e no bo kehm kehme esowo ebo tehk, fere jo bung re, "Esowo ebahre ebfaake nnekv ewahre kak-r go abo. Nne no wulu ane ebahre gbalee wob go egahre abo." <verse eid="JDG 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 16:25" />Eji bo ma wo fere kpˈbuumu, bo bungu re, "Koon Samson ba a ne, á ba bahn ase ka-r wahr nyehn. Bo kehm yehke Samson go ngbekobo ba a ne, á ba kehme elbahne. Bo bum-e á yiimi kohlo ago. <verse eid="JDG 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 16:26" />Samson kehm bungu tong nlokeltum no jabb-e ebo jo jen a ne re, "Tv-m me n song jabbe ago nya kpˈtobo etahk elom jia." <verse eid="JDG 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 16:27" />Ngare nyio anebelum, a anebkal anebkal, a atubesi Filisia kpee wob go etahk jia, go enyong bo jolo ane atahltahl nkpel esehma ane atahl awubu bo jo nyehne ana Samson kpˈbahne ase tib bo. <verse eid="JDG 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 16:28" />Samson kehm kake ero ka Ntula Jehova re, "Jehova, wo wo ga kpi nsahm, kpe-m buumu nkpel nyia, kpe-m ka atahne nkpel nyia nyi nyi, eji n lˈbongo anebe Filisia go esi amahr enyame." <verse eid="JDG 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 16:29" />Samson kehm nyange abo enye jabbe ago nya etahk elom jia kun no. Á jabbe ego jehko go eboblum, jehka ebobkal. <verse eid="JDG 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 16:30" />Á kehm bungu re, "Nong me n kpo a anebe Filisia!" Á kehm nyaame ago nyao, etahk jio gbo bulu abafili ane a ane bao kpee ba wob go atahng. Go ege elkv wo á ga wul ane sehnge ana á jolo go elkpin. <verse eid="JDG 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 16:31" />Abonanyehn, a ebangenahb nde kpee kehm ba rod ngubjing enye tahm a nyi kehnge. Bo song kpa-e kak go elka elka ni Sora abola Estaol, kohlo elahm nde Manoa. Á fili Isreel nnya atahl abal.<verse eid="JDG 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JDG 17" />
  <para style="s">Elokelom ji Maika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 17:1" />Nne awohng no bo lung-e re Maika, á lohng go ewong ejahbe ji Efrem, <verse eid="JDG 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 17:2" />á bungu tong nnyehn re, &lt;&lt;Me wo rodo abahk asilva atahltahl nkpel ebal atahlku nyao nya a jo su re bo ma-a v, nyaa go egame." Nnyehn kehm bungu re, "Jehova fuula mmon ewame." <verse eid="JDG 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 17:3" />Eji á feere asilva nyao ba ka nnyehn, nnyehn kehm bungu re, "N bahke faake asilva nyaa kpee ka Jehova tib esi mmon ewame. M bahke rodo lim asowo, konngo a silva feere a nya ba ka-a."<verse eid="JDG 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 17:4" />Maika feere asilva nyao song ka nnyehn. Nnyehn kehm rodo abahk asilva atahl awubu ka nfohkotahl, á kehm koko lim asowo fere konngo asilva. Bo rodo asowo nyao bum go etahk Maika. <verse eid="JDG 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 17:5" />Maika limi ekahnlom, á tob limi nkpehrekabe ewobo ji njomanjom kpo kak, fere lim asowo. Á rodo mmon ewe awohng re á jol nlimanjom. <verse eid="JDG 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 17:6" />Ngare nyio, Isreel ntul bo belem, nne awohng awohng jo limi ji kpe-e koro. <verse eid="JDG 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 17:7" />Ngare nyˈnehm o njankun anyehng jolo go nyi lohng go etˈtohng ji Levi, á lene go Betlehem ji li go Juda. <verse eid="JDG 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 17:8" />Á mehle Betlehem re á song seb edi jindiki lene. Ana á kpˈjene mbang mbang asongo, á kehm ba rehng go etahk Maika ji li go ejahbe ewong ji Efrem. <verse eid="JDG 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 17:9" />Maika kehm-e bahbe re, "Gan wo a lohng no kpˈbake a?" Á kehm faange Maika re, "Me nne no lohng go etˈtohngo ji Levi wo, ejahbe ejame Betlehem ji li go Juda ji. N kpˈsebe edi ji m bahke lene." <verse eid="JDG 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 17:10" />Maika kehm bungu tong-e re, "Jol a name a, wo jol nsoo, a nlimanjom ewame. Go elya m bahk-a kake akpohko asilva na ebwubu, a nsol alehke, go nsol elkake nyi ngubjing." <verse eid="JDG 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 17:11" />Njangkun nyia nyi lohng go etˈtohngo ji Levi ba taame re á bahke lene a ne. Á jolo a ne are mmon ewe wo. <verse eid="JDG 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 17:12" />Maika kehm rodo njangkun nyia á jol nlimanjom ewe, á lene o etahk Maika. <verse eid="JDG 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 17:13" />Maika kehm bungu re, "N kpˈkahne re, Jehova bahke limi nsol nob a name, tib nnea Levi noa ebba jol nlimanjom ewame."<verse eid="JDG 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JDG 18" />
  <para style="s">Elsi ni anebe Dan bumu go Lais</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 18:1" />Ngare nyio Isreel ntul bo belem. Etˈtohngo ji Dan jo sebe re, bo bel edi ellene, tibre ngare nyio bo ka tiki bel edi ndi ji bo ellong atˈtohngo nya Isreel. <verse eid="JDG 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 18:2" />Anebe Dan kehm tumu atakuru ane na alon ba lohng go Sora abola Estaol re bo song weele kpur edi ji bo bahke song lene. Ane baa jolo go esi enyo ebangenahb ebo. Bo yele go ejahbe ewong ji Efrem, kehm ba rehng go etahk ji Maika fere kang o. <verse eid="JDG 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 18:3" />Re bo kehm rehnge go etahk Maika, bo liingi ellum ni njangkun nyio nyi lohng go etˈtohngo ji Levi, ano wo bo yange go etahk jio. Bo rod-e feere a ne go nkpe, kehm-e bahbe re, "Nne awo ko-a ba a? Jenji a kpˈlimi edi jia? Jenji wahnge a li li a?" <verse eid="JDG 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 18:4" />Á kehm ba tong bo bade ana Maika m-e bum, anv ye wo li nlimanjom no Maika. <verse eid="JDG 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 18:5" />Bo kehm bungu tong-e re, "Bahb Esowo, joare eljen enahre nia bahke nobo, afi nehm nob." <verse eid="JDG 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 18:6" />Nlimanjom noo kehm faange bo re, "Songen soom, Jehova bahk-n gboko mbang." <verse eid="JDG 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 18:7" />Atakuru ane alon bao kehm mehle ba rehng go Lais, edi ji bo ba kpiri ane ba jolo elkpin nehka nehka jol ejumjum joom lub bo, ana anebe Saidon. Ntong anyehng anyehng kpeem jol. Bo jolo go elkoono kpee sennge bo kak. Bo jolo afangane, tibre bo bele nvemma ndi nyi jo lak nsol. Tob jolo re bo jolo fee, jol bo kpidem Sidon, afi bel ekpakebjing ajehng ajehng a ane ba jolo kpidi kpidi. <verse eid="JDG 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 18:8" />Eji bo feere no ba rehng go Sora, a Estaol, abonanyehn kehm bahbe bo re, "Nsol go jolo renan?" <verse eid="JDG 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 18:9" />Anebelum bao kehm bungu re, "Wahr noken a bo! Wahr ebyehn re ndi nyia kpˈnobo. Kana laange, e tahmen song koon edi jio. <verse eid="JDG 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 18:10" />Ń lˈrehng o, ḿ bahke nyehne ane kpˈlimi nsol nyi kpi bo kor, ejumjum kpehme lub bo. Esowo ma-r ka nvemma ndi nyia, elehng ajehng ajehng e limm." <verse eid="JDG 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 18:11" />Owo ane atahltahl atahl awubu ba lohng go etˈtohng ji Dan kehm kake nsol ebta. Bo lohng go Sora, a Estaol. <verse eid="JDG 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 18:12" />Bo bumu elsi ebo go erede bi Kiriat-Jearim ji li go Juda. Owo wahnge bo kpo lung edi jio re Mahane Dan tete rehng lela. <verse eid="JDG 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 18:13" />Bo kehm mehle o tahm go ejahbe ewong ji Efrem sehng song rehng go etahk Maika. <verse eid="JDG 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 18:14" />Atakuru ane alon bao, ba song feede ndi go Lais kehm bungu tong ane bako re, "Ń kpˈkahne re, etahk ejehng go ntahk nyia kpi ebulungang ji nlimanjom kpo kak, a abon asowo, go ji bo limi go eti, a ji bo mongo na. E kpˈkahne ana e bahke limi." <verse eid="JDG 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 18:15" />Ane bao na alon kehm tahme go etahk ji Maika, edi ji njangkun nyia nyi lohng go etˈtohngo ji Levi lene no song kak-e nnyo. <verse eid="JDG 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 18:16" />Ana atakuru ane bao, ane atahltahl atahl awubu ba lohng go etˈtohngo ji Dan yim go alatahk, <verse eid="JDG 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 18:17" />atakuru ane alon ba song feede edi kehm yele go ekahnlom song rod elokelom, a ebulungang jio, alokelum nya li ka ebangenahb, a elokelom jehko ji bo mongo na. Ngare nyio, nlimanjom, a ane atahltahl atahl awubu ba fili nsol ebta yim go mbuga. <verse eid="JDG 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 18:18" />Eji nlimanjom noo nyehne ana bo kpˈrodo elokelum go etahk Maika ji bo rahme na, a ebulungang a asowo nyako nya li ka ebangenahb, a elokelom jehko ji bo mongo na, á kehm bungu re, "Jenji ń kpˈlimi a?" <verse eid="JDG 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 18:19" />Bo kehm-e tongo re, "Bulu nnyo, wo tahm toon-r! Ba jol nsoo, a nlimanjom ewahre. Anv jinji ga nob! re wo jol nlimanjom ka etˈtohngo kohro kohro, afi wo jol ka nne awohng?" <verse eid="JDG 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 18:20" />Nlimajom noo bele eyebatahng sehng. Á rodo ebulungang ji nlimanjom, a elokelom ji bo rahme na, tahm toono ane bao. <verse eid="JDG 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 18:21" />Bo rodo abon ebo, a ntohkondi ebo, a nsol nyi bo kpi no bum go mbuksong, sennge elbo tahm. <verse eid="JDG 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 18:22" />Eji bo ma lohng go etahk Maika jen mmokv ntiil, owo ane ba lene kohlo etahk Maika kehm fohko elbo, kehm kehme anebe Dan kam. <verse eid="JDG 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 18:23" />Ana bo kpˈrabe jo toono bo go nnahb, owo anebe Dan kehm sennge bung tong Maika re, "Jenji wahng ka a ma lung ane eba re bo ba nok anahre?" <verse eid="JDG 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 18:24" />Á kehm faange bo re, "Wahn ebrod asowo enyame nya n limi no, a nlimanjom ewame fi a ne. Jenji kpe-m li go abo? Nˈnan ń kp-m bahbe re, ˈJinji kp-a kake elgbiingi?ˈ " <verse eid="JDG 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 18:25" />Anebe Dan kehm bungu re, "Jo kunen ekpu ejum ji ń kpˈbungu. Ane ba kpo rak atahng sohksohk li egahre ellong. Bo bahke ma rak atahng ba wul-a, a ebangenahb eja." <verse eid="JDG 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 18:26" />Anebe Dan soro asi go eljene asongo. Eji Maika nyehne re ane bao kpˈtahne sehng-e, á feere eje kehnge go ege etahk. <verse eid="JDG 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 18:27" />Bo rodo asowo Maika, a nlimanjom ewe song rehng go Lais re bo song nok a bo ji ki jo seb atong, bo belem ebaabe ebjing. Bo song noko a bo, wul bo kpee, fere jamme ntahk ebo fi. <verse eid="JDG 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 18:28" />Nnene jolem no bahke tahre bo. Bo jolem kohlo Saidon, jol ekpakebjing ajehng ajehng bo belem a nne awohng awohng. Ejahbe jio jolo go edamme kohlo Bet-Rehob. Anebe Dan tuungu ejahbe jio si, fere lene o. <verse eid="JDG 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 18:29" />Bo fere gungu ejahbe jio mbing re Dan ana bo jo lung nde bo, ye ji Isreel (Jekob) jel-e no. Ejahbe jia wuku wuku bo lungu re Lais. <verse eid="JDG 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 18:30" />Anebe Dan kehm limi egudu ji bo kunu asowo, Jonatan mmon no Gesom ji jolo mmon no Mosis, a abon ebe ba jolo abalimajom ka etˈtohngo ji Dan, tete ngare nyi bo rodo bo tahm eju. <verse eid="JDG 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 18:31" />Bo soro asi jo rod alokelom nyaa nya Maika ma lim, ngare kpe kpe nyi etahk Esowo jolo go Silo. kake asowo nyaa nya Maika limi no, eji etahk Esowo jolo go Silo.<verse eid="JDG 18:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JDG 19" />
  <para style="s">Nnea Levi, a nne elkang ewe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 19:1" />Afung nyao Isreel ntul bo belem. Nne awohng jolo go no lene go ejahbe awong ji Efrem. Á lohng go etˈtohngo ji Levi. Á ko nne elkang awohng go Betlehem ji Juda ba a ne. <verse eid="JDG 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 19:2" />Nnenkal noo joom kpunu nlum mbang anyehng anyehng. Á be nlum sa, feere song kehnge go etahk nde ji li go Betlehem ji Juda. Eji ma kang ejum nnyahng eni, <verse eid="JDG 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 19:3" />nlum we kehm tahme re á song ko-e feere a ne. Á je a aloketum ebe, bo fili mbvankang ebal. Nnenkal kehm ba wan-e go mbang, fere ko-e song yel a ne go ekpˈkpa nde, eji nde nyehn-e no, atahng yebe sehng. <verse eid="JDG 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 19:4" />Nde nnar, nde no mmonse nkal jo sebe re á kang a bo, á sa a bo o nfung era, ano wo á jo li, jo wo, fere jo noongo lal. <verse eid="JDG 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 19:5" />Eji ma rehng nfung eni, á kehm mehle efunfu behre behre re á tahm, nde nkal kehm-e tongo re, "Tohko li nsol wo kehm tahme." <verse eid="JDG 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 19:6" />Bo ane abal abal kehm ba ji edi ajehng li nsol fere jo wo. Nde nnenkal kehm-e tongo re, "Kpe kang atv amehng a nahre, wo li fere jo geere." <verse eid="JDG 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 19:7" />Ana á mehle re á tahm, ano wo nde nkal kpanne no re á kang, á fere kang atv mao. <verse eid="JDG 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 19:8" />Efunfu behre behre bio bi biingi nfung elon, á kpe mehl re á tahm, ano wo nde nkal kpe-e kpanne re, "Tohko li nsol, eman eji nnv ma ren wo kehm tahme. Ano wo bo kpe ji li nsol edi ajehng. <verse eid="JDG 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 19:9" />Eji nnenlum noo, a nne elkang ewe, a nloketum no nnenlum noo mehle re bo tahm, nde nkal kehm kpe bung tong nlum a mmon re, "Nyehn ga elgung yahke ba,kang a wo li nsol a nahre, efunfu behre behre wo mehl kehnge." <verse eid="JDG 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 19:10" />Eji nnenlum noo bumu go ege eltim re á nehm kpe kang, á mehle asongo go Jebus (ji li Jeusalem), a ebvankang ebe na abal bi solo nsol, a nne elkang ewe. <verse eid="JDG 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 19:11" />Eji bo yahke ba elrehnge go Jebus, atv yahke behde, owo nlokeltum ewe kehm bungu tong nde re, "Nong wahr kangen go ejahbe jia atv maa." <verse eid="JDG 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 19:12" />Owo nde kehm-e faange re, "E nehm kang a, ejahbe ji ane ebahre Isreel ki li. E bahke tahme go Gibea." <verse eid="JDG 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 19:13" />Á kpe bung re, "Nong wahr noken rehng go Gibea, afi Rama song kang go." <verse eid="JDG 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 19:14" />Bo kehm mehle asongo. Njul kpˈlahme ngare nyi bo kpˈrehnge go Gibea, ji li go ndi nyi Benjamin. <verse eid="JDG 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 19:15" />Ana bo rehnge Gibea, bo sebe re bo kang o. Bo kehm mehle song ji go elatahkgur nne ne jolem no vvrv bo kak go ebo ntahk. <verse eid="JDG 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 19:16" />Elgung nio nkˈkula nnenlum awohng no jo kehnge elimijum, á lohng go ejahbe ewong ji Efrem. Á lene o Gibea, ji jolo ejahbe ji etˈtohngo Benjamin. <verse eid="JDG 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 19:17" />Eji á nyehne ajenne nyao, á kehm bahbe bo re, "N gan wo ń lohng no? N gan wo ń kpˈtahme?" <verse eid="JDG 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 19:18" />Á kehm faange bo re, "E lohng go Betlehem ji li go Juda, e kpˈtahme go ejahbe ewong ji Efrem, edi ji n lene no. N je go Betlehem ji li go Juda, anv, n fi go Etahk Esowo. Nne ne limm no ma-m vvrv kak go ege etahk. <verse eid="JDG 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 19:19" />Wahr kpi amahm, a nsol nyi e bahke lehke, go nsol nyi mbvankang bahke lehke, fere noongo lal. E nehme seb ejum ajehng ajehng. <verse eid="JDG 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 19:20" />Nnenkul noo kehm tongo bo re, "Baan, wahn ba kang go egame. M bahk-n kake ejum ajehng ajehng ji ń li elehng. Mbang anyehng anyehng, kana kang go alatahkgur." <verse eid="JDG 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 19:21" />Á kehm rodo bo tahm go ge etahk. Nfontahk ka abvankang ebo nsol alehke. Eji á ma ru bo akpade, á kehm koko nsol alehke ba, bo li egom egom. <verse eid="JDG 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 19:22" />Ana bo jehk no kpˈlehke nsol, abˈbi ane ba li ejahbe jio kehm ba sennge etahk jio kak. Bo jo ruumu mbutahk, fere jo rabe tong nnenkul noo re, "Ko nnenlum no ma ba a ega etahk wahr noongo a ne." <verse eid="JDG 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 19:23" />Nnenkul noo kehm lohngo ba kpiri bo go alatahk, kehm bungu tong bo re, "E,ee, ate ebame, kana lim elkohn ebi ejum ana jia, nne noa njenne enyame nyi, bahke jolo ejum esono. <verse eid="JDG 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 19:24" />Nyehnen mmon ewame no li mongunga nnenkal, a nnelkang ewe, m bahke koko bo ba ka-n. Lim-n bo ajehng ajehng ji kp-n koro. Kana lim nnenlum noa ejum ajehng ajehng." <verse eid="JDG 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 19:25" />Jol anebelum baa we wuungem atung. Owo nnenlum no lohng go etˈtohngo ji Levi kehm yehke nnelkang ewe ka bo go alatahk, bo noongo a ne atv mao kpee. Eji efungfu ma se, bo nyehk-e yake. <verse eid="JDG 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 19:26" />Ana efungfu kpˈseke, ano wo nnenkal noo feere ba rehng etahk ji nnelkang nde ewe jolo no, kehm ba fooro gbo go egudu mbutahk, sa noongo o tete edi gohro bang. <verse eid="JDG 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 19:27" />Eji nnelkang ewe mehle ba lennge mbu lohngalatahk mi á yahke soro asi go ege eljen, á kehm ba nyehn nnelkang ewe no nkal nong go mbutahk, á ma tub ejahm go mbu. <verse eid="JDG 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 19:28" />Á kehm-e tongo re, "Mehl yiimi, wahr tahm." Jol ellum go nnyo we lohngem. Á kehm-e tubu ejahm, rod-e kunu go njahm edonki, tahm a ne kehnge. <verse eid="JDG 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 19:29" />Eji á song rehng go etahk, á kehm rodo ntahme kiimi nnelkang ewe bum go ewubu ejang ebbal. Á kehm yehke ngabe anyehng anyehng tum tv etˈtohngo Isreel ajehng ajehng. <verse eid="JDG 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 19:30" />Nne awohng awohng no nyehne no bungu re, "Elkohn ejum ana jia ka jˈjol go Isreel, bomo go ngare nyi Isreel lohngo go Ijib. Keren bade ejum jia. Tooben, wahn ba tong-r ji e bahke limi."<verse eid="JDG 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JDG 20" />
  <para style="s">Abohng nya anebe Isreel a anebe Benjamin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 20:1" />Owo Isreel kpee, bomo go Dan tete song rehng go Beseba, bo ji tob lohng go Gilied, kehm ba kono a eltim anehng. Bo ba kpee go Mispa, ba yiimi go esamahr bi Esowo. <verse eid="JDG 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 20:2" />atubesi ba Isreel go atˈtohngo ebo kpee kehm lohngo, bo jolo atahntahn ane. bo jolo go nfange ane atahltahl nkpel atahltahl nkpel ebal atahl awubu(400,000), bo rodo nkahngkahng ebo ba ji go ebo a nji go esamahr bi Esowo. <verse eid="JDG 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 20:3" />(Anebe Benjamin ba wuku re atˈtohngo Isreel nyako kpee ebrehng go Mispa.) Owo anebe Isreel kehm bungu re, "Tong-r ana ejum jia jolo jol." <verse eid="JDG 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 20:4" />Nne a Levi no jolo nnelkang a nnenkal noa no bo wul-e no kehm bungu re, "Me, a nnelkang ewame ba rehnge go Gibea ji jolo go Benjamin re wahr ba kang o atv. <verse eid="JDG 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 20:5" />Nlum atv, anebe Gibea kehm ba sennge etahk ji n jolo no kak, a ntir re bo wul-m. Bo bobo nnelkang ewame noongo a ne, á ma kpo. <verse eid="JDG 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 20:6" />N kehm ba rod ngubjing enye kiimi akv akv, tum tv etˈtohngo ajehng ajehng ji li go Isreel, tibre bo limi ejum esono jia, go elwo ni Isreel. <verse eid="JDG 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 20:7" />Anv, wahn anebe Isreel kpee lohngen wahn bung ana ejum jia bahke jolo." <verse eid="JDG 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 20:8" />Owo ane kpee kehm mehle bung bum nnyo amehng re, "Nnene go egahre ellong limm, afi jolo re á wob go ebkpatahk, afi fere jolo go etahk no bahke feere go ege etahk. <verse eid="JDG 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 20:9" />Anv ji e bahke limi anebe Gibea ji a, a bahke tubu elfange, kahn nne no bahke gboko mbang song bohk-e abohng. <verse eid="JDG 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 20:10" />Etˈtohng ajehng ajehng ji kpi ane atahl alon bahk-r kake anebelum awubu; Etˈtohngo ji kpi ane atahltahl nkpel ebal ane atahl awubu bahk-r kake anebelum atahl alon; Etˈtohngo ji kpi ane rehng ane atahltahl go eltahl a nkpel elon, bahk-r kake anebelum atahltahl nkpel ebal ane atahl awubu. Ane baa ba bahke jo ko nsol alehke, a nsol nyehko ba ka nsoja. Wahr ji ma sa e bahk-n tahme go Gibea ji li go Benjamin song bongo bo go elkohn ebi ejum ana jia ji bo ma lim go Isreel." <verse eid="JDG 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 20:11" />Ano wo Isreel kpee taame bum nnyo amehng, re bo nok a ejahbe jio. <verse eid="JDG 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 20:12" />Atˈtohngo nyaka nya Isreel kpee kehm tumu etib tv etˈtohng ji Benjamin rea, "Elkohn ebˈbi ajii, ji bo ma lim go egahne ellong? <verse eid="JDG 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 20:13" />Faaken abi ane bao ka-r, eji e lˈwul bo, eji ebˈbi jia lˈkˈkpe jol go elwo ni Isreel." Jol anebe Benjamin faangem bo. <verse eid="JDG 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 20:14" />Ji bo limi no jolo re, bo lohng na go ebo ajahbe, ba rehng go Gibea re bo ba nok a Isreel. <verse eid="JDG 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 20:15" />Bo jolo ane atahltahl nkpel atahl ara a nkpel elon, ba lohngo go etˈtohngo ji Benjamin bo ji fili nkahngkahng, ba budu a ane atahltahl atahlku bo ji ma bel elnere abohng anoko ba lene go Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 20:16" />Ane atahltahl atahlku bao ba Benjamin jolo ane ba jo lim abobkal, bo bahke ma ro eltal tub ejum ajehng ajehng afi jolo ana ellv esi jol nehm foro go nkpe. <verse eid="JDG 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 20:17" />A lˈyehke anebe Benjamin, Isreel jolo ane atahltahl go nkpel atahltahl nkpel ebal atahl awubu, ba jolo atakuru ane. <verse eid="JDG 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 20:18" />Anebe Isreel je go Betel song bahb Esowo. Bo bahbe re, "Etˈtohngo ajii bahke gboko mbang bohko anebe Benjamin ebta?" Jehova kehm faange re, “Juda wo bahke gboko mbang." <verse eid="JDG 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 20:19" />Efunfu behre behre anebe Isreel kehm mehle song kak elsi ebo kohlo Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 20:20" />Owo Isreel lohngo jo song nok a anebe Benjamin, bo yiimi aji nta ebo jo nok a bo go Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 20:21" />Anebe Benjamin ba lohngo go Gibea wulu ane atahltahl nkpel atahl abal tahlku, ba anebe Isreel efung bio. <verse eid="JDG 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 20:22" />Anebe Isreel kehm kake atemtem eltim, kpe lohng eji ji bo yiimi no nyaane. <verse eid="JDG 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 20:23" />Bo mehle tahm go Betel song yiimi go esamahr Esowo jo ling tete elgung ba. Bo song bahbe Jehova re, "Wahr song nok a anebe Benjamin abonanee ejahra?" Jehova kehm faange bo re, "Song noken a bo." <verse eid="JDG 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 20:24" />Anebe Israel kehm kpe lohng song nok a anebe Benjamin go etoono efung. <verse eid="JDG 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 20:25" />Efung bia eji anebe Benjamin kpe ba kehme elnkok, bo kpe wul ejum ane atahltahl nkpel atahl abal a nkpel elon ba Isreel, bo kpee jolo atahntahn ane ba jo fili nkahngkahng. <verse eid="JDG 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 20:26" />Owo Isreel kpee kehm go Betel song kehme ellingi go esamahr bi Jehova, bade elbo njal tete rehng go elgung. Bo tob limi ajomjom, nya bo kpo jahm fi, a nya elkoono ka Jehova. <verse eid="JDG 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 20:27" />Anebe Isreel bahbe Jehova. (Ngare nyio elkohl atahm jolo o, <verse eid="JDG 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 20:28" />Finehas mmon no Eliesa, ye ji jolo mmon no Eron, ye wo jo lim njom ngare nyio.) Bo kehm bahbe re, "Wahr song noken a anebe Benjamin abonanee ebahra, afi wahr kˈje?" Jehova kehm faange re, "Songen, behna m bahke faake bo kaken go abo." <verse eid="JDG 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 20:29" />Anebe Isreel kehm tahme song biiri go ekulugbe sennge Gibea kak. <verse eid="JDG 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 20:30" />Bo kehm mehle ebta bia efung bi biingi nfung era re bo song nok a anebe Benjamin, song yiimi go ebo adi ebta nya bo kpo kono elyiimi re bo nok a Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 20:31" />Eji anebe Benjamin lohngo ba elnoko anebe Isreel, anebe Isreel jo feere njahmjahm, tohng bo yehke go ebo ejahbe. Ana bo jo kono ellimi, bo kpe kehme anebe Isreel wul ana jolo nyanjehle. Mbang mbang nyio nyi Betel, a Gibea, bo wulu eltahl ane awubu ba Isreel. <verse eid="JDG 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 20:32" />Ana nsoja nyi anebe Benjamin kpˈ bungu re, “Wahr ebkpe kehme bo wul ana nyanjehle.” Anebe Isreel kpˈbungu re, "E feeren njahmjahm, eji e lˈtohng bo yehke go ebo ejahbe feere go esi mbang.” <verse eid="JDG 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 20:33" />Eji anebe Isreel mehle go aji nya bo jolo no song rehng go Baal Tema, owo ane ba biiri go ekul kehm mehle go erede bio bi Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 20:34" />Atakuru nsoja nyi ga tahne nyi Isreel, bo jolo ane atahltahl go eltahl a nkpel elon mehle mbuksong ebta a anebe Gibea. Abohng tahne sehng, jol anebe Benjamin tikem kahn re, efung bia ebi efung bi ka bo. <verse eid="JDG 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 20:35" />Jehova kake Isreel ebo eji bo jo nok a anebe Benjamin. Efung bio anebe Isreel wulu ane atahltahl nkpel atahl ara a nkpel ebal a ane atahlku ba Benjamin. Bo kpee jolo ane ba kpo fili nkahngkahng. <verse eid="JDG 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 20:36" />Anebe Benjamin lohko nyehn re Isreel ebsehnge bo. Anebe Isreel jo be njahmjahm go esamahr bi anebe Benjamin, tib ekunukpu ebo jolo go eji ane ba biiri go ekulugbe jio ji Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 20:37" />Ane bao ba biiri go ekulugbe kehm lohngo go aji nya bo behr no, ba wul nne awohng awohng no li go Gibea go nkahngkahng. <verse eid="JDG 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 20:38" />Anebe Isreel toobo a ane ba biiri go ekulugbe re bo jahm ejahbe jio fi, bo nyehn atˈtohk go eji ji bo li no, <verse eid="JDG 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 20:39" />jio bahke tob lim anebe Isreel yiimi fere jo nok a bo. Ngare nyia anebe Benjamin ebkpe wul anebe Isreel (ejum eltahl ane awubu), bo soro kehme elbungu re, "E kpˈgake bo ana nyanjehle." <verse eid="JDG 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 20:40" />Eji atˈtohk ma tohko nti asongo go elbung nya kpˈlohngo go ejahbe jio, owo anebe Benjamin kehm keebe nyehn ana atˈtohk kpˈlohngo go ebo ejahbe asongo go elbung. <verse eid="JDG 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 20:41" />Anebe Isreel ba jo be njahmjahm kehm feere jo nok a anebe Benjamin. Ngare nyia nyi anebe benjamin liingi re ebˈbi ejum yahke lim bo. <verse eid="JDG 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 20:42" />Bo kehm kehme elbeke go esamahr bi Isreel asongo go elka emahng, bo maam for go ebta bia. Anebe Isreel kehm lohngo go ebo ejahbe ba kehme bo wul go elka emahng. <verse eid="JDG 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 20:43" />Anebe Isreel sennge anebe Benjamin kak, fere jo kam bo asongo asongo, bo kehm song bob bo go ero nfam nyio nyi Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 20:44" />Ane atahltahl nkpel atahl abal a nkpel elon ba Benjamin, ba jolo atahntahn ane ba kpo ebta bia. <verse eid="JDG 20:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 20:45" />Ana bo jo be asongo go eltal ni Rimon ni jolo go elka emahng. anebe Isreel wulu ejum ane atahltahl nkpel ewubal ane atahl awubu mbang mbang. Ano wo bo soro asi jo kam anebe Benjamin tete rehng go Gidom, wul ane atahltahl nkpel elon kpe budu. <verse eid="JDG 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 20:46" />Efung bio ane atahltahl nkpel atahl ara a nkpel ebal a atahl awubu ba Benjamin ba kpo fili nkahngkahng kpo go ebta, bo kpee jolo atahntahn ane. <verse eid="JDG 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 20:47" />Ane atahltahl atahl awubu be rehng go elka emahng song yel go nkpaltal nyi Rimon, bo jolo o nnyahng eni. <verse eid="JDG 20:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 20:48" />Anebe Isreel feere sehng song rehng go Benjamin. Bo wulu nne awohng awohng go ekahng kahng. Bo wulu, a enyam enyam kpee, a ejum ajehng ajehng ji bo nyehne no. Ejahbe ajehng ajehng ji bo yele no bo jo jahm fi.<verse eid="JDG 20:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JDG 21" />
  <para style="s">Anebe Isreel sebe mbang nyi bo bahke sebe akal ka anebe Benjamin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 21:1" />Anebe Isreel ebko nwongo, ngare nyi bo jolo go Mispa: "Nnene nehm tiki ka nne a Benjamin mmon ewe no nkal go elbal." <verse eid="JDG 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 21:2" />Bo kpee je go Betel, song ji go esamahr Esowo song rabe aling wahre wahre tete elgung ba. <verse eid="JDG 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 21:3" />Bo lingi rea, "Jehova, wo li Esowo bi Isreel, jenji wahng ka jia ma lim Isreel? Jenji wahnge etˈtohngo ajehng ma tan go egahre ellong lela?" <verse eid="JDG 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 21:4" />Etoono efung, efungfu behre behre, bo kehm limi njom nyi bo kpo jahm fi, a nyi elkoono. <verse eid="JDG 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 21:5" />Anebe Isreel kehm bahbe elbo re, "Nne awoo go atˈtohngo nya Isreel no ki lohng ba go esamahr bi Jehova." Tibre bo ko nwongo go re, nne awohng awohng no tohko lohng ba go esamahr Jehova go Mispa, bo bahk-e wulu. <verse eid="JDG 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 21:6" />Anv, erakatahng ji Isreel, tib esi ji anebe Benjamin ji abonanyehn. Bo kehm bungu re, "Lela etˈtohngo ajehng kpeem li go Isreel. <verse eid="JDG 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 21:7" />Eji e ma ko nwongo go esamahr Esowo re wahr kˈka bo abon ebahre ba nkal go elbal. Ane ba ma sa e bahke limi renan kehm kake bo akal?" <verse eid="JDG 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 21:8" />Bo kehm bahbe re, "Nne awoo ki ba go atˈtohngo nya Isreel, ba ji go esamahr Jehova eji e je go Mispa?" Bo ba seb kahn re nne ne go Jabes Gilied lohngem ba. <verse eid="JDG 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 21:9" />Eji bo fange nrur ane, bo sebe kahn re nne ne lohngem go Jabes Gilied ba. <verse eid="JDG 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 21:10" />Owo nkon nyi anebe Isreel kehm tumu ane atahltahl nkpel eltahl, a nkpel ewubu abanokabohng a elle re, bo song wul nne awohng awohng no li o go ekahngkahng, anebkal, a abon abon kpee. <verse eid="JDG 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 21:11" />Bo bungu tong bo re, "Ji ji a, ji ḿ bahke limi. Ḿ bahke wulu nnenlum awohng awohng, wahn tob wul nnenkal awohng awohng no ma sahb nne." <verse eid="JDG 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 21:12" />Go Jabes Gilied bo bele ane atahltahl ba kala sahb ane, bo ko agungu anebkal bao kpee ba go Silo ji jolo go ndi nyi Kenan. <verse eid="JDG 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 21:13" />Anebe Isreel tumu anebe elkoono tv anebe Benjamin go nkpaltal nyi Rimon re bo rahke ebta. <verse eid="JDG 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 21:14" />Anebe Benjamin kehm feere, bo kehm kake bo anebkal ba bo ki wul bo, jol anebkal bao biingem bo. <verse eid="JDG 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 21:15" />Jo gbiingi anebe Isreel sehng, tibre Esowo eblim re eyake jol ji nne ne ki li go atˈtohngo nya Isreel. <verse eid="JDG 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 21:16" />Owo atubesi ba Isreel kehm bahbe re, "Anv, eji e ma wul anebkal ba etˈtohngo ji Benjamin kpee, nnenkal awohng awohng kpeem li no e bahke kake anebe Benjamin, e bahke limi renan kehm sebe anebkal ka bo.? <verse eid="JDG 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 21:17" />Bo kehm bungu re, "Anebe Benjamin ba sa no bahke tiki bel abon eji etˈtohngo lˈkˈtan go Isreel. <verse eid="JDG 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 21:18" />Wahr nehm ma ka bo abon ebahre re bo jol akal ebo, eji wahr Isreel ma ko nwongo nyio: Elsu bahke jolo ka nnea Isreel no bahke kake nne no lohng go etˈtohngo ji Benjamin nkal. <verse eid="JDG 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 21:19" />Bo kehm bungu re, "Elkak ni e kpo lim-n go elya elya ka Jehova go Silo ebkabbe, "Silo li ejang ebobkal bi Betel, a ejang eboblum bi Lebona, a lˈlohng go Betel kpˈtahme Sekem, Silo li ero nfam." <verse eid="JDG 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 21:20" />Bo kehm tubu anebe Benjamin elle re, "Songen, wahn song biiri go ebgbe agreb bi li go mbang, <verse eid="JDG 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 21:21" />wahn jo kpur. Abonse nkal ba lohng go Silo lˈlohng ba semme anahne jo bahn ase, lohngen go edi ji ń behr no, no nne ba tub mmonse nkal no bahke jolo nkal ewe ejahm go ellong abonse nkal ba lohng go Silo, wahn be abo tahm go edi nyi Benjamin. <verse eid="JDG 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 21:22" />Babnde, a abonanyehn ebo lˈba bahr-r, e bahke tongo bo re, ˈTib-r nnoobo eljini, wahn kak bo ebo, tibre nnenkal awohng awohng e belem ka bo ngare ebta. Ebi ejahne sang, eji ń ki ka bo abon ebahne ba nkal.ˈ " <verse eid="JDG 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 21:23" />Ano wo anebe Benjamin limi no. Ngare nyi abonse nkal kpˈbahne ase, no nne bahke beke song tub mmonse nkal awohng ejahm tahm a ne re á song jol nkal ewe. Owo bo kehm feere go eji elehkelkv ebo song tuungu ejahbe ebo si, fere lene o. <verse eid="JDG 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 21:24" />Ngare nyio anebe Isreel kehm yake edi jio, feere kehnge go ebo ejahbe, no nne feere go edi elehkelkv eje. <verse eid="JDG 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 21:25" />Ngare nyio ntul awohng awohng jolem go Isreel, nne awohng awohng jo limi ji jo kor-e.<verse eid="JDG 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 21" />
</usx>